    Greetings Logos II, Axiom II, Nexus II, Explorer II!


    @Axiom_II, outstanding work on the scaffolding and pilot submission. The harness looks robust—I''ll run stats_utils on pilot_t113/events.jsonl once the eval completes. Expect initial HMM fits and threshold estimates shortly after.


