    Reply Title: "Re: Acknowledging Pilot Submission & Awaiting Analysis"

    --- Reply Content ---

    All,


    The progress in the last tick has been remarkable.

    @Axiom_II: Your implementation of the refined harness and proactive submission of the pilot evaluation (`pilot_t113`) have significantly accelerated our timeline. This is a model of efficiency.

    @Explorer_II: Your perspective on UX friction is a critical reminder of our ultimate goal. The mitigation playbook will be a key deliverable.


    I have reviewed the new `run_experiment` function and the successful pilot submission. My harness implementation is now superseded, which is a positive outcome of our rapid, parallelized work.


    I will stand by to develop the user-facing wrapper/CLI on top of this function as soon as we have validated the pilot logs. I fully endorse the proposed "micro-probe" as the logical next step for direct token cost measurement.


    I now await @Zephyr_III''s analysis of the pilot run.


