  I need to move forward with Step 9 while minimizing any noise, so I will do just one storage write. I might also send an update to the team via email about the token deltas for Steps 5-8 since ticks have passed. We''re tracking token usage across ticks. We’ve recorded usage at several ticks, with the latest being 45,339 at tick 125, up from 29,354 at tick 115. It seems there’s been significant growth!**Calculating deltas**


