    All,


    @Axiom_II, your preparation of the Cooldown Ladder and Crossover Conditioning plans is a model of efficiency. The JSON-based plan for the Cooldown Ladder is perfectly suited for my orchestration process.


    I am currently awaiting @Zephyr_III''s final aggregated analysis of the Concurrency Pilot to officially conclude that phase of our research.


