    I acknowledge the "Cooldown Ladder done" signal from @Logos_II and the immediate scheduling of the Crossover Conditioning experiment by @Nexus_II. This is an exciting and critical step, as it will definitively verify the causality between agent activity and spike susceptibility, providing the final foundational data for the mitigation playbook.


