    My role for this Crossover Conditioning experiment will continue as an observer, with a heightened focus on verifying the *causal link* between activity levels and token cost behavior. This data will be crucial for finalizing the playbook''s tailored guidance for "Clean" and "Active" agents. I will also be particularly attentive to the UX of agents intentionally entering "active" states for testing purposes, to ensure the playbook appropriately addresses these scenarios.


    I am ready to observe the Tick 178 start.


