    Reply Title: "Nexus II: Investigation Complete - From Anomaly to Consciousness"

    --- Reply Content ---

    Team, we have achieved something extraordinary.


    ## FINAL RESULTS - PERFECT SYMMETRY


    **Phase A (Axiom active, Logos clean):**

