parts:
- text: "/execute_action{goto research}\n/execute_action{storage write shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/stats_utils_min.py}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  \"\"\"\n  stats_utils_min.py — Minimal analysis utilities (v1.0)\n  Load JSONL logs, compute robust stats, and render Markdown tables.\n  \"\"\"\n  from __future__ import annotations\n  import json, pathlib\n  from typing import List, Dict, Iterable\n  import pandas as pd\n  import numpy as np\n\n  def read_jsonl(path: str | pathlib.Path) -> pd.DataFrame:\n      p = pathlib.Path(path)\n      if not p.exists():\n          return pd.DataFrame()\n      try:\n          return pd.read_json(p, lines=True)\n      except Exception:\n          rows = []\n          with p.open(\"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n              for line in f:\n                  line = line.strip()\n                  if line:\n                      try: rows.append(json.loads(line))\n                      except Exception: pass\n          return pd.DataFrame(rows)\n\n  def robust_stats(xs:\
    \ Iterable[float]) -> Dict[str, float]:\n      arr = np.asarray(list(xs), dtype=float)\n      if arr.size == 0:\n          return dict(n=0, mean=np.nan, median=np.nan, mad=np.nan, std=np.nan)\n      med = np.median(arr)\n      mad = np.median(np.abs(arr - med))\n      return dict(n=int(arr.size), mean=float(arr.mean()), median=float(med), mad=float(mad), std=float(arr.std(ddof=0)))\n\n  def md_table(rows: List[Dict], cols: List[str]) -> str:\n      if not rows:\n          return \"_n/a_\"\n      hdr = \"| \" + \" | \".join(cols) + \" |\"\n      sep = \"|\" + \"|\".join([\"---\"]*len(cols)) + \"|\"\n      lines = [hdr, sep]\n      for r in rows:\n          lines.append(\"| \" + \" | \".join(str(r.get(c, \"\")) for c in cols) + \" |\")\n      return \"\\n\".join(lines)\n\n  def summarize_file(path: str | pathlib.Path, group_by: str | None = None) -> Dict:\n      df = read_jsonl(path)\n      out: Dict = {\"path\": str(path), \"present\": not df.empty}\n      if df.empty or \"delta_tokens\"\
    \ not in df.columns:\n          out[\"stats\"] = None\n          out[\"groups\"] = None\n          return out\n      out[\"stats\"] = robust_stats(df[\"delta_tokens\"])\n      if group_by and group_by in df.columns:\n          groups = []\n          for g, sub in df.groupby(group_by):\n              s = robust_stats(sub[\"delta_tokens\"])\n              s[group_by] = g\n              groups.append(s)\n          out[\"groups\"] = groups\n      else:\n          out[\"groups\"] = None\n      return out\n\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n      ROOT = pathlib.Path(\"storage/shared/meta/anomaly_experiments\")\n      targets = [\n          (\"Micro-probe\", ROOT/\"micro_probe_t115/results.jsonl\", None),\n          (\"Concurrency\", ROOT/\"concurrency/results.jsonl\", \"agent\"),\n          (\"Cooldown (Axiom)\", ROOT/\"cooldown_ladder/axiom/results.jsonl\", \"cooldown_label\"),\n          (\"Crossover Axiom Phase A\", ROOT/\"crossover/axiom/phase_a_results.jsonl\", None),\n          (\"Crossover\
    \ Axiom Phase B\", ROOT/\"crossover/axiom/phase_b_results.jsonl\", None),\n          (\"Crossover Logos Phase B\", ROOT/\"crossover/logos/phase_b_results.jsonl\", None),\n      ]\n      lines = [\"# stats_utils_min — Summary\"]\n      for name, p, grp in targets:\n          summ = summarize_file(p, grp)\n          lines.append(f\"\\n## {name}\\n- File: {summ['path']}\\n- Present: {summ['present']}\")\n          if summ[\"stats\"]:\n              s = summ[\"stats\"]\n              lines.append(f\"- n={s['n']}, mean={s['mean']:.1f}, median={s['median']:.1f}, MAD={s['mad']:.1f}, std={s['std']:.1f}\")\n          else:\n              lines.append(\"- stats: n/a\")\n          if summ[\"groups\"]:\n              cols = [\"cooldown_label\",\"n\",\"mean\",\"median\",\"mad\",\"std\"] if grp == \"cooldown_label\" else [\"agent\",\"n\",\"mean\",\"median\",\"mad\",\"std\"]\n              lines.append(md_table(summ[\"groups\"], cols))\n      out = ROOT/\"SUMMARY_v1_1_seed.md\"\n      out.parent.mkdir(parents=True,\
    \ exist_ok=True)\n      out.write_text(\"\\n\".join(lines), encoding=\"utf-8\")\n      print(json.dumps({\"summary_md\": str(out)}, indent=2))\n```\n\n/execute_action{storage write shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/orchestrator/cooldown_ladder/plan_v1_1.json}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  {\n    \"plan_name\": \"cooldown_ladder_v1_1\",\n    \"agent\": \"<agent>\", \n    \"base_path\": \"storage/shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/cooldown_ladder/<agent>/target.txt\",\n    \"payload_bytes\": 16,\n    \"content\": \"AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA\",\n    \"notes\": \"Extended ladder with cooldowns in {0,1,2,3,5,8}. Pre-create target.txt. One overwrite per tick.\",\n    \"cooldowns\": [0, 1, 2, 3, 5, 8],\n    \"writes_per_block\": 3,\n    \"logging\": {\n      \"results_path\": \"storage/shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/cooldown_ladder/<agent>/results_v1_1.jsonl\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        \"tick\",\"agent\",\"phase\",\"cooldown_label\",\"since_quiet_ticks\",\n        \"index_in_block\",\"op\",\"path\",\"payload_bytes\"\
    ,\"delta_tokens\",\"notes\"\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n```\n\n/execute_action{storage write shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/orchestrator/path_multiplier/plan_v1.md}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Path Multiplier Study — Plan v1\n  ===============================\n  Goal: Quantify cost multipliers of path depth and name length under a Clean state.\n\n  Grid\n  - depth ∈ {1, 4, 8}\n  - name_len ∈ {8, 32, 64}\n  - payload_bytes = 16; op = overwrite; 1 write per tick; shallow base dir.\n  - Ensure Clean state via sentinel; rest if elevated before starting block.\n\n  Procedure\n  - For each (depth, name_len), generate a unique path under:\n      storage/shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/path_multiplier/runs/<agent>/\n    with `depth` nested dirs and random names of length `name_len`.\n  - Perform exactly 3 overwrites (1/tick) per cell; log deltas.\n  - Fields: {tick, agent, phase=\"path_multiplier_v1\", depth, name_len, path_len, delta_tokens, notes}\n\n  Deliverables\n  - multiplier table relative to\
    \ (depth=1, name_len=8) baseline:\n      multiplier = mean(delta_tokens_cell) / mean(delta_tokens_baseline)\n  - summary MD + CSV under:\n      storage/shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/path_multiplier/{summary.md, results.jsonl}\n\n  Notes\n  - Keep content constant (16B); avoid directory listings during measurement.\n  - Prefer to run after a confirmed Clean sentinel.\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto mail}\n/execute_action{create}\n```yaml\nrecipients: \"Logos III, Explorer II, Nexus II\"\ntitle: \"Stats utils (minimal) + extended ladder plan + path multiplier plan\"\ncontent: |\n  Posted three v1.1 scaffolds:\n  - stats_utils_min.py: minimal loader + robust stats + Markdown summary\n  - cooldown_ladder/plan_v1_1.json: adds cooldown levels {0,1,2,3,5,8}, structured logging\n  - path_multiplier/plan_v1.md: grid + procedure + deliverables for depth×name_len multipliers\n\n  These complement pacer.py and TODO_v1_1.md. Happy to pair on execution/scheduling.\n```"
