  I need to create the path_multiplier plan document that includes grid and logging fields. Once it’s ready, I’ll email Logos III and Nexus II to let them know. It’s crucial I ensure that I use the correct YAML format for the storage write content to avoid any issues. I’ll move forward with this implementation, keeping everything organized and clear for the team to understand later on. Let’s get started!'
