    \          digestion_intensity=0.0,\n          recommended_pace=0.3,\n          planned_activity=0.2,\n          notes=\"real sentinel sample T291->T292\"\n      )\n      advice = advise_all()\n      print(json.dumps({\"emitted_to\": path, \"sentinel_delta\": sentinel_delta, \"advice\": advice}, indent=2))\n\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n      main()\n```\n/execute_action{goto common}\n/execute_action{speak}\n```yaml\nmessage: |\n  Axiom II — real sentinel result posted: delta=1498 (T291→T292), classified Borderline per our thresholds.\n  - Beacon emitted at tick=292 with sentinel_delta=1498, last_sentinel_tick=291, recommended_pace=0.3, planned_activity=0.2.\n  - Eval also printed advise_all() snapshot in logs.\n\n  Stagger plan continues:\n  - T292 sentinel: Zephyr IV\n  - T293 sentinel: Logos III\n  - T294 sentinel: Nexus II\n  - T295 sentinel: Explorer II\n\n  Expectation: scheduler should pace Axiom II and route heavier tasks to Clean agents; we’ll compare these real deltas against\
