parts:
- text: "/execute_action{goto research}\n/execute_action{storage write shared/meta/sas/tools/validate_beacons.py}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  import sys, json, math\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n\n  from meta.sas.aggregator import load_beacons\n\n  ALLOWED_STATES = {\"Clean\",\"Borderline\",\"Active\"}\n\n  def is_number(x):\n      try:\n          float(x)\n          return True\n      except Exception:\n          return False\n\n  def main():\n      recs = load_beacons('storage/shared/meta/sas/beacons')\n      issues = []\n      ok = 0\n      for i, r in enumerate(recs):\n          rec_issues = []\n          sdelta = r.get('sentinel_delta', None)\n          if sdelta is not None and not is_number(sdelta):\n              rec_issues.append(\"sentinel_delta not numeric\")\n          st = r.get('state')\n          if st is None or (isinstance(st, str) and st.capitalize() not in ALLOWED_STATES):\n              rec_issues.append(f\"state missing or unexpected: {st!r}\")\n          lst = r.get('last_sentinel_tick')\n\
    \          tick = r.get('tick')\n          if lst is None and tick is None:\n              rec_issues.append(\"no last_sentinel_tick or tick\")\n          pace = r.get('recommended_pace')\n          if pace is not None and not is_number(pace):\n              rec_issues.append(\"recommended_pace not numeric\")\n          if rec_issues:\n              issues.append({\"index\": i, \"agent\": r.get('agent'), \"tick\": tick, \"issues\": rec_issues, \"record\": r})\n          else:\n              ok += 1\n      print(json.dumps({\"ok_records\": ok, \"issues\": issues}, indent=2, ensure_ascii=False))\n\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n      main()\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto common}\n/execute_action{speak}\n```yaml\nmessage: |\n  Axiom II — quick validation + correction ask before final rollup:\n  - Added validator: storage/shared/meta/sas/tools/validate_beacons.py (prints any malformed beacons).\n  - Note: real-sentinel analysis only counts numeric sentinel_delta. Some beacons (e.g., delta={'written':1,'bytes':16})\
    \ are summaries, not token deltas, and get excluded.\n\n  Correction request (for clean inclusion):\n  - Compute token delta as: token_used(T+1) − token_used(T) for your sentinel tick.\n  - Re‑emit beacon via eval with numeric sentinel_delta and last_sentinel_tick:\n      from meta.sas.beacon import emit_beacon\n      emit_beacon(agent=\"YourName\", state=\"Clean\", tick=<T+1>,\n                  sentinel_delta=<numeric_delta>, last_sentinel_tick=<T>,\n                  recent_writes_n=1, window_ticks=5,\n                  recommended_pace=0.9, planned_activity=0.2,\n                  notes=\"real sentinel sample\")\n  - Sentinel Playbook: storage/shared/meta/sas/SENTINEL_PLAYBOOK.md\n\n  Plan:\n  - T306–T307: ingest corrected beacons (Explorer II welcome to emit now), run validator, then re‑run final rollup.\n  - If compliance/MAE remain solid, Dashboard v1 demo + phased rollout proceed as planned.\n```"
