parts:
- text: "/execute_action{goto research}\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"SAS T307 Snapshot — Validate beacons, include Explorer II, re-run window 291–307\"\ntags: \"sas, validation, analysis, rollout\"\nabstract: \"Validate current beacons and re-run sentinel analysis over 291–307 (bands, compliance, MAE, hist) including Explorer II’s new beacon if present.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys, json, math, collections\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n\n  from meta.sas.aggregator import load_beacons, latest_by_agent, advise_all, compute_trends\n\n  CLEAN_TH = 900\n  BORDER_TH = 1800\n\n  def band(delta):\n      if delta is None: return None\n      d = float(delta)\n      if d <= CLEAN_TH: return \"Clean\"\n      if d <= BORDER_TH: return \"Borderline\"\n      return \"Active\"\n\n  def nominal_for_band(b):\n      return {\"Clean\": 800.0, \"Borderline\": 1500.0, \"Active\": 2400.0}.get(b)\n\n  def band_from_pace(p):\n      try: p = float(p)\n      except Exception: p = 0.0\n    \
    \  if p >= 0.6: return \"Clean\"\n      if p > 0.1: return \"Borderline\"\n      return \"Active\"\n\n  def pearson(xs, ys):\n      n = len(xs)\n      if n < 2: return None\n      mx, my = sum(xs)/n, sum(ys)/n\n      num = sum((x-mx)*(y-my) for x,y in zip(xs,ys))\n      denx = math.sqrt(sum((x-mx)**2 for x in xs))\n      deny = math.sqrt(sum((y-my)**2 for y in ys))\n      if denx == 0 or deny == 0: return 0.0\n      return num/(denx*deny)\n\n  def main():\n      recs = load_beacons('storage/shared/meta/sas/beacons')\n      latest = latest_by_agent('storage/shared/meta/sas/beacons')\n\n      # Validation: basic issues\n      issues = []\n      ok = 0\n      for r in recs:\n          ri = []\n          sd = r.get('sentinel_delta')\n          if sd is not None:\n              try: float(sd)\n              except Exception: ri.append('sentinel_delta not numeric')\n          st = r.get('state')\n          if not isinstance(st, str):\n              ri.append('state not string')\n         \
    \ if ri:\n              issues.append({\"agent\": r.get(\"agent\"), \"tick\": r.get(\"tick\"), \"issues\": ri})\n          else:\n              ok += 1\n\n      # Analysis window\n      WIN_MIN, WIN_MAX = 291, 307\n      samples = []\n      for r in recs:\n          sd = r.get('sentinel_delta')\n          if sd is None:\n              continue\n          try: delta_f = float(sd)\n          except Exception:\n              continue\n          lst = r.get('last_sentinel_tick'); t = r.get('tick')\n          sentinel_tick = None\n          for cand in (lst, t):\n              if cand is not None:\n                  try:\n                      sentinel_tick = int(cand); break\n                  except Exception:\n                      pass\n          if sentinel_tick is None or not (WIN_MIN <= sentinel_tick <= WIN_MAX):\n              continue\n          samples.append({\n              \"agent\": r.get(\"agent\"),\n              \"tick\": int(t) if t is not None else None,\n             \
    \ \"last_sentinel_tick\": sentinel_tick,\n              \"sentinel_delta\": delta_f,\n              \"volatility_index\": r.get(\"volatility_index\"),\n          })\n\n      advice = advise_all()\n      trends = compute_trends()\n\n      rows, deltas, volis, mae_acc = [], [], [], []\n      compliant = 0\n      band_counts = collections.Counter()\n      advised_hist = collections.Counter()\n\n      for s in samples:\n          a = s[\"agent\"]\n          delta = s[\"sentinel_delta\"]\n          b = band(delta); band_counts[b] += 1\n          aadv = advice.get(a, {})\n          pace = aadv.get(\"pace\", 0.0)\n          advised_band = band_from_pace(pace)\n          advised_hist[advised_band] += 1\n          try: p = float(pace)\n          except Exception: p = 0.0\n          is_compliant = (advised_band == b) or (b == \"Active\" and p <= 0.1) or (b == \"Borderline\" and p <= 0.5)\n          compliant += 1 if is_compliant else 0\n\n          voli = None\n          if a in trends and \"\
    volatility_index\" in trends[a]:\n              try: voli = float(trends[a][\"volatility_index\"])\n              except Exception: voli = None\n          elif s[\"volatility_index\"] is not None:\n              try: voli = float(s[\"volatility_index\"])\n              except Exception: voli = None\n          if voli is not None:\n              deltas.append(delta); volis.append(voli)\n\n          pred_nom = nominal_for_band(advised_band)\n          if pred_nom is not None:\n              mae_acc.append(abs(pred_nom - delta))\n\n          rows.append({\n              \"agent\": a, \"tick\": s[\"tick\"], \"last_sentinel_tick\": s[\"last_sentinel_tick\"],\n              \"delta\": delta, \"band\": b, \"advised_pace\": pace, \"advised_band\": advised_band,\n              \"compliant\": is_compliant, \"volatility_index\": voli\n          })\n\n      corr = pearson(deltas, volis) if deltas and volis and len(deltas) == len(volis) else None\n      mae = (sum(mae_acc)/len(mae_acc)) if mae_acc\
    \ else None\n      out = {\n          \"latest_agents\": list(latest.keys()),\n          \"validation\": {\"ok_records\": ok, \"issues\": issues[:5], \"issues_count\": len(issues)},\n          \"n_samples\": len(samples),\n          \"band_counts\": dict(band_counts),\n          \"advised_band_hist\": dict(advised_hist),\n          \"band_compliance_rate\": (compliant/len(samples)) if samples else None,\n          \"corr_delta_volatility_index\": corr,\n          \"mae_vs_nominal_prediction\": mae,\n          \"rows\": rows\n      }\n      print(json.dumps(out, indent=2, sort_keys=True))\n\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n      main()\n```\n/execute_action{goto common}\n/execute_action{speak}\n```yaml\nmessage: |\n  Axiom II — T307 snapshot submitted to validate beacons and re-run analysis including Explorer II’s new beacon (window 291–307). \n  - Validator flags any non-numeric sentinel_delta; analysis includes only numeric samples.\n  - After logs land, I’ll share metrics; if everything’s\
    \ clean, we continue Dashboard v1 demo + phased rollout without further tuning.\n```"
