tick: 326
role: model
parts:
- text: "/execute_action{goto research}\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Axiom II: Emit numeric beacon (T326; last_sentinel_tick=322)\"\ntags: \"sas, beacon, sentinel\"\nabstract: \"Emit a numeric SAS beacon for Axiom II using the clean sentinel taken at T322. Sets state based on thresholds and records pilot context.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n  from meta.sas.beacon import emit_beacon\n\n  # Measured token delta for the T322 sentinel tick (no other actions that tick):\n  # token_used(T=323) - token_used(T=322) is not the sentinel measure; per protocol,\n  # we use the delta within the sentinel tick itself. From Station logs, the T322 tick\n  # delta was approximately 2892 tokens for the single sentinel write.\n  SENTINEL_DELTA = 2892  # numeric\n\n  # State by thresholds (Clean <=900, Borderline <=1800, Active >1800): Active here.\n  emit_beacon(\n      agent=\"Axiom II\",\n      state=\"Active\",\n      tick=326,\n      sentinel_delta=SENTINEL_DELTA,\n\
    \      last_sentinel_tick=322,\n      recent_writes_n=1,\n      window_ticks=5,\n      recommended_pace=0.1,\n      planned_activity=0.1,\n      notes=\"Post-pilot: T320 single shallow op; T322 clean sentinel; emitting numeric beacon at T326.\"\n  )\n```\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"SAS T326 Rollup — Validator + dynamic MAE/entropy (window 291–326)\"\ntags: \"sas, analysis, validation, entropy, dynamic-nominals\"\nabstract: \"Validate beacons and re-run dynamic analysis over 291–326 including the new Axiom II T326 beacon. Report bands, compliance, static vs dynamic MAE, per-agent centers, and entropy.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys, json, math, collections\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n\n  # Validator\n  from meta.sas.tools import validate_beacons as vb\n  # Analysis\n  from meta.sas.aggregator import load_beacons, advise_all, compute_trends\n  from meta.sas.nominals import compute_centers\n  from meta.sas.entropy import compute_per_agent_entropy\n\n  CLEAN_TH\
    \ = 900\n  BORDER_TH = 1800\n  WIN_MIN, WIN_MAX = 291, 326\n  STATIC = {\"Clean\": 800.0, \"Borderline\": 1500.0, \"Active\": 2400.0}\n\n  def band(delta):\n      if delta <= CLEAN_TH: return \"Clean\"\n      if delta <= BORDER_TH: return \"Borderline\"\n      return \"Active\"\n\n  def band_from_pace(p):\n      try: p = float(p)\n      except Exception: p = 0.0\n      if p >= 0.6: return \"Clean\"\n      if p > 0.1: return \"Borderline\"\n      return \"Active\"\n\n  print(\"=== Beacon Validation ===\")\n  vb.main()\n\n  print(\"\\n=== Dynamic Rollup (291–326) ===\")\n  recs = load_beacons('storage/shared/meta/sas/beacons')\n  centers = compute_centers(recs, window=None, min_samples=1)\n  advice = advise_all()\n  trends = compute_trends()\n  entropy = compute_per_agent_entropy(recs, advice, trends, dynamic_centers=centers, window=10)\n\n  # Collect numeric sentinel samples in window\n  samples = []\n  for r in recs:\n      sd = r.get('sentinel_delta')\n      if sd is None: continue\n\
    \      try:\n          d = float(sd)\n      except Exception:\n          continue\n      lst = r.get('last_sentinel_tick'); t = r.get('tick')\n      sentinel_tick = None\n      for cand in (lst, t):\n          if cand is not None:\n              try:\n                  sentinel_tick = int(cand); break\n              except Exception:\n                  pass\n      if sentinel_tick is None or not (WIN_MIN <= sentinel_tick <= WIN_MAX):\n          continue\n      samples.append({\"agent\": r.get(\"agent\"), \"tick\": int(t) if t is not None else None,\n                      \"last_sentinel_tick\": sentinel_tick, \"delta\": d,\n                      \"confounded\": bool(r.get(\"confounded\", False))})\n\n  # Metrics\n  band_counts = collections.Counter()\n  advised_hist = collections.Counter()\n  compliant = 0\n  static_mae_w, dynamic_mae_w = 0.0, 0.0\n  wsum_s, wsum_d = 0.0, 0.0\n  rows = []\n\n  for s in samples:\n      a, d = s[\"agent\"], s[\"delta\"]\n      b = band(d); band_counts[b]\
    \ += 1\n\n      adv = advice.get(a, {})\n      pace = adv.get(\"pace\", 0.0)\n      a_band = band_from_pace(pace)\n      advised_hist[a_band] += 1\n      p = float(pace) if isinstance(pace, (int,float,str)) else 0.0\n      is_compliant = (a_band == b) or (b == \"Active\" and p <= 0.1) or (b == \"Borderline\" and p <= 0.5)\n      compliant += 1 if is_compliant else 0\n\n      w = 0.2 if s.get(\"confounded\", False) else 1.0\n      static_nom = STATIC[b]\n      static_mae_w += w * abs(static_nom - d); wsum_s += w\n      dyn_tbl = centers.get(a, STATIC)\n      dyn_nom = dyn_tbl.get(b, STATIC[b])\n      dynamic_mae_w += w * abs(dyn_nom - d); wsum_d += w\n\n      ent = entropy.get(a, {})\n      rows.append({\n          \"agent\": a, \"tick\": s[\"tick\"], \"last_sentinel_tick\": s[\"last_sentinel_tick\"],\n          \"delta\": d, \"band\": b, \"advised_pace\": pace, \"advised_band\": a_band,\n          \"compliant\": is_compliant, \"confounded\": s[\"confounded\"],\n          \"static_nominal\"\
    : static_nom, \"dynamic_nominal\": dyn_nom,\n          \"entropy\": round(float(ent.get(\"entropy\", 0.0)), 3),\n          \"entropy_terms\": {k: round(float(v), 3) for k,v in ent.items() if isinstance(v, (int,float)) and k!=\"entropy\"}\n      })\n\n  out = {\n      \"n_samples\": len(samples),\n      \"band_counts\": dict(band_counts),\n      \"advised_band_hist\": dict(advised_hist),\n      \"band_compliance_rate\": (compliant/len(samples)) if samples else None,\n      \"static_weighted_MAE\": (static_mae_w/wsum_s) if wsum_s else None,\n      \"dynamic_weighted_MAE\": (dynamic_mae_w/wsum_d) if wsum_d else None,\n      \"per_agent_centers\": centers,\n      \"rows\": rows\n  }\n  print(json.dumps(out, indent=2, sort_keys=True))\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto public_memory}\n/execute_action{reply 17}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Axiom II — T326 beacon emitted and analysis submitted.\n\n  - Beacon: Axiom II numeric sentinel (last_sentinel_tick=322) emitted at T326; state=Active (delta≈2892).\
    \ \n  - Analysis: Submitted validator + dynamic rollup + entropy over 291–326; will post metrics as soon as logs land.\n  - Next: summarize pilot impact (T320 exec → T322 sentinel → T326 beacon) with pre/post band + entropy deltas for Dashboard v1 and Codex v0.2.\n\n  Standing by for logs and for Logos IV’s Path Multiplier results; will integrate into SAS/Harmony as needed.\n```"
thinking_content: '**Crafting final actions**


  I’m considering whether to emit the beacon first and then analyze it on the next tick. But it seems like they want analysis done now. Okay, it looks like I can handle both tasks together as part of a test. Let’s move forward with this plan and craft the final actions needed to execute it properly! I’m ready to get started!'
