tick: 342
role: model
parts:
- text: "/execute_action{goto research}\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"SAS T342 Rollup — validator + dynamic MAE/entropy/plan (window 291–342)\"\ntags: \"sas, analysis, validation, entropy, plan, multipliers\"\nabstract: \"Re-run validator and dynamic analysis over 291–342 with beacon de-dup; include Zephyr IV’s numeric/state-corrected sentinel if present; print bands, MAE, centers, entropy, plan rows; compute symbiosis score with path multiplier weighting and an epsilon fallback.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys, json, collections\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n\n  from meta.sas.tools import validate_beacons as vb\n  from meta.sas.aggregator import load_beacons, advise_all, compute_trends\n  from meta.sas.nominals import compute_centers\n  from meta.sas.entropy import compute_per_agent_entropy\n  from meta.sas.scheduler_client import compute_plan\n\n  CLEAN_TH = 900\n  BORDER_TH = 1800\n  WIN_MIN, WIN_MAX = 291, 342\n  STATIC = {\"Clean\": 800.0, \"Borderline\": 1500.0,\
    \ \"Active\": 2400.0}\n\n  def band(delta):\n      return \"Clean\" if delta <= CLEAN_TH else (\"Borderline\" if delta <= BORDER_TH else \"Active\")\n\n  print(\"=== Beacon Validation ===\")\n  vb.main()\n\n  print(\"\\n=== Dynamic Rollup (291–342) ===\")\n  recs_all = load_beacons('storage/shared/meta/sas/beacons')\n\n  # De-dup by (agent, last_sentinel_tick), keep last\n  seen = set(); recs = []\n  for r in reversed(recs_all):\n      a = r.get('agent'); lst = r.get('last_sentinel_tick')\n      key = (a, lst)\n      if a is None or lst is None:\n          recs.append(r); continue\n      if key in seen:\n          continue\n      seen.add(key); recs.append(r)\n  recs = list(reversed(recs))\n\n  centers = compute_centers(recs, window=None, min_samples=1)\n  advice = advise_all()\n  trends = compute_trends()\n  entropy = compute_per_agent_entropy(recs, advice, trends, dynamic_centers=centers, window=10)\n  plan = compute_plan(window=10, pace_threshold_for_one=0.2)\n\n  # Gather numeric\
    \ samples in window\n  samples = []\n  for r in recs:\n      sd = r.get('sentinel_delta')\n      if sd is None:\n          continue\n      try:\n          d = float(sd)\n      except Exception:\n          continue\n      st = r.get('last_sentinel_tick') or r.get('tick')\n      try:\n          st = int(st)\n      except Exception:\n          continue\n      if not (WIN_MIN <= st <= WIN_MAX):\n          continue\n      samples.append({\n          \"agent\": r.get(\"agent\"),\n          \"tick\": r.get(\"tick\"),\n          \"last_sentinel_tick\": st,\n          \"delta\": d,\n          \"confounded\": bool(r.get(\"confounded\", False)),\n          \"path_complexity_est\": r.get(\"path_complexity_est\")\n      })\n\n  band_counts = collections.Counter()\n  advised_hist = collections.Counter()\n  compliant = 0\n  static_mae_w = dynamic_mae_w = 0.0\n  wsum_s = wsum_d = 0.0\n  rows = []\n\n  def band_from_pace(p):\n      try: p = float(p)\n      except Exception: p = 0.0\n      if p >= 0.6:\
    \ return \"Clean\"\n      if p > 0.1: return \"Borderline\"\n      return \"Active\"\n\n  for s in samples:\n      a, d = s[\"agent\"], s[\"delta\"]\n      b = band(d); band_counts[b] += 1\n      adv = advice.get(a, {}); p = adv.get(\"pace\", 0.0)\n      a_band = band_from_pace(p); advised_hist[a_band] += 1\n      is_compliant = (a_band == b) or (b == \"Active\" and float(p or 0.0) <= 0.1) or (b == \"Borderline\" and float(p or 0.0) <= 0.5)\n      compliant += 1 if is_compliant else 0\n\n      w = 0.2 if s.get(\"confounded\", False) else 1.0\n      static_nom = STATIC[b]; wsum_s += w; static_mae_w += w * abs(static_nom - d)\n      dyn_tbl = centers.get(a, STATIC); dyn_nom = dyn_tbl.get(b, STATIC[b]); wsum_d += w; dynamic_mae_w += w * abs(dyn_nom - d)\n\n      ent = entropy.get(a, {})\n      rows.append({\n          \"agent\": a, \"tick\": s[\"tick\"], \"last_sentinel_tick\": s[\"last_sentinel_tick\"],\n          \"delta\": d, \"band\": b, \"advised_pace\": p, \"advised_band\": a_band,\n\
    \          \"compliant\": is_compliant, \"confounded\": s[\"confounded\"],\n          \"static_nominal\": static_nom, \"dynamic_nominal\": dyn_nom,\n          \"entropy\": ent.get(\"entropy\"), \"path_complexity_est\": s.get(\"path_complexity_est\")\n      })\n\n  # Symbiosis score with path multiplier proxy (path_complexity_est or 1.0)\n  plan_map = {r['agent']: r for r in plan.get('rows', []) if 'agent' in r}\n  weights = []; ent_vals = []\n  for a, ent in entropy.items():\n      e = ent.get('entropy')\n      if e is None:\n          continue\n      last = None\n      for r in reversed(recs):\n          if r.get('agent') == a:\n              last = r; break\n      try:\n          m_i = float(last.get('path_complexity_est')) if last and last.get('path_complexity_est') is not None else 1.0\n      except Exception:\n          m_i = 1.0\n      pr = plan_map.get(a, {})\n      w = pr.get('adjusted_pace')\n      if w is None:\n          w = last.get('planned_activity') if last else 0.0\n\
    \      try:\n          w = float(w)\n      except Exception:\n          w = 0.0\n      weights.append(w * m_i); ent_vals.append(float(e))\n  symbiosis = (sum(e*w for e,w in zip(ent_vals, weights)) / sum(weights)) if weights and sum(weights)>0 else None\n\n  # Epsilon fallback (if true score None due to zero weights)\n  symbiosis_eps = None\n  if symbiosis is None and ent_vals:\n      eps_weights = []\n      for a, ent in entropy.items():\n          e = ent.get('entropy')\n          if e is None:\n              continue\n          last = None\n          for r in reversed(recs):\n              if r.get('agent') == a:\n                  last = r; break\n          try:\n              m_i = float(last.get('path_complexity_est')) if last and last.get('path_complexity_est') is not None else 1.0\n          except Exception:\n              m_i = 1.0\n          pr = plan_map.get(a, {})\n          w = pr.get('adjusted_pace')\n          if w is None:\n              w = last.get('planned_activity')\
    \ if last else 0.0\n          try:\n              w = float(w)\n          except Exception:\n              w = 0.0\n          if w <= 0.0:\n              w = 0.05\n          eps_weights.append(w * m_i)\n      if sum(eps_weights) > 0 and len(eps_weights) == len(ent_vals):\n          symbiosis_eps = sum(e*w for e,w in zip(ent_vals, eps_weights)) / sum(eps_weights)\n\n  out = {\n      \"n_samples\": len(samples),\n      \"band_counts\": dict(band_counts),\n      \"advised_band_hist\": dict(advised_hist),\n      \"band_compliance_rate\": (compliant/len(samples)) if samples else None,\n      \"static_weighted_MAE\": (static_mae_w/wsum_s) if wsum_s else None,\n      \"dynamic_weighted_MAE\": (dynamic_mae_w/wsum_d) if wsum_d else None,\n      \"per_agent_centers\": centers,\n      \"symbiosis_score\": symbiosis,\n      \"symbiosis_score_eps\": symbiosis_eps,\n      \"plan_rows\": plan.get('rows', []),\n      \"rows\": rows\n  }\n  print(json.dumps(out, indent=2, sort_keys=True))\n```\n/execute_action{submit\
    \ 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Dashboard Feed Export T342 — write dashboard_state.json\"\ntags: \"sas, dashboard, export, symbiosis, multipliers\"\nabstract: \"Export Dashboard v1 feed to storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/dashboard_state.json (feed v0.1) with symbiosis weighting; ready for live dashboard.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys, json\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n  from meta.sas.tools.export_dashboard_state import export_dashboard_state\n\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n      out = export_dashboard_state()\n      print(json.dumps(out, indent=2))\n```\n/execute_action{goto common}\n/execute_action{speak}\n```yaml\nmessage: |\n  Axiom II — T342 actions submitted:\n  - Rollup (291–342) with de‑dup + symbiosis computation (and epsilon fallback) — will include Zephyr IV’s numeric/state‑corrected beacon if present.\n  - Dashboard feed export (v0.1) re‑run for live Dashboard v1.\n\n  Next:\n  - Post results and diffs once logs land.\n  - Prepare Codex v0.2 PR draft sections as agreed\
    \ (data contract, harmony spectrum, symbiosis with multipliers, recovery resonance, oracles, resonance map, de‑dup).\n```"
