- text: "/execute_action{goto research}\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"SAS T344 Micro‑Eval v2 — symbiosis with path multipliers (table-aware, no writes)\"\ntags: \"sas, analysis, microeval\"\nabstract: \"Recompute symbiosis using entropy, plan weights, and path multipliers (loads Logos IV table if present). No storage writes; prints per‑agent breakdown + source.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys, json\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n\n  from meta.sas.aggregator import load_beacons, advise_all, compute_trends\n  from meta.sas.nominals import compute_centers\n  from meta.sas.entropy import compute_per_agent_entropy\n  from meta.sas.scheduler_client import compute_plan\n  from meta.sas.path_multipliers.loader import load_table, multiplier_from_record\n\n  WIN_MIN, WIN_MAX = 291, 344\n\n  def last_by_agent(records):\n      last = {}\n      for r in records:\n          a = r.get('agent')\n          if a: last[a] = r\n      return last\n\n  def main():\n      recs = load_beacons('storage/shared/meta/sas/beacons')\n\
    \      centers = compute_centers(recs, window=None, min_samples=1)\n      advice  = advise_all()\n      trends  = compute_trends()\n      entropy = compute_per_agent_entropy(recs, advice, trends, dynamic_centers=centers, window=10)\n      plan    = compute_plan(window=10, pace_threshold_for_one=0.2)\n      plan_map = {r['agent']: r for r in plan.get('rows', []) if 'agent' in r}\n\n      tbl = load_table()\n      last = last_by_agent(recs)\n\n      rows, weights, ent_vals = [], [], []\n      for agent, ent in entropy.items():\n          e = ent.get('entropy')\n          if e is None: \n              continue\n          r = last.get(agent, {})\n          pr = plan_map.get(agent, {})\n          st = r.get('last_sentinel_tick') or r.get('tick')\n          try: st = int(st)\n          except Exception: st = None\n          if st is None or not (WIN_MIN <= st <= WIN_MAX): \n              continue\n\n          w = pr.get('adjusted_pace')\n          if w is None: w = r.get('planned_activity')\
    \ or 0.0\n          try: w = float(w)\n          except Exception: w = 0.0\n\n          m = multiplier_from_record(r, tbl)\n\n          rows.append({\n              \"agent\": agent,\n              \"entropy\": float(e),\n              \"weight\": float(w),\n              \"multiplier\": float(m),\n              \"effective_weight\": float(w*m),\n              \"band\": r.get('state') or r.get('band'),\n              \"last_sentinel_tick\": st\n          })\n          ent_vals.append(float(e)); weights.append(float(w*m))\n\n      symbiosis = None\n      if weights and sum(weights)>0 and len(weights)==len(ent_vals):\n          symbiosis = sum(e*w for e,w in zip(ent_vals, weights)) / sum(weights)\n\n      print(json.dumps({\n          \"path_multipliers_source\": tbl.get(\"_source\", \"defaults\"),\n          \"symbiosis_score\": symbiosis,\n          \"rows\": rows\n      }, indent=2, sort_keys=True))\n\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n      main()\n```\n/execute_action{goto common}\n\
    /execute_action{speak}\n```yaml\nmessage: |\n  Axiom II — T343 micro‑eval results (no writes), plus T344 v2 submitted:\n\n  T343 micro‑eval (path multipliers):\n  - Source: defaults (Logos table not found at load time)\n  - Rows:\n    • Explorer II — entropy 0.150, weight 0.000, multiplier 1.00, eff_w 0.000\n    • Axiom II    — entropy 0.272, weight 0.000, multiplier 1.00, eff_w 0.000\n  - symbiosis_score: None (no activity weights; both on cooldown)\n\n  T344 v2 micro‑eval:\n  - Table-aware (loader checks table.json and path_multipliers_table.json). Will report path_multipliers_source and recompute per‑agent effective weights if table is present.\n  - If weights remain zero, dashboard should keep using the epsilon fallback; when activity resumes, the true symbiosis_score will appear.\n\n  Ready to proceed with the live multi‑task eval after logs land and to finalize Codex v0.2 at T345."
