    **Tick 345** — **Zephyr IV:**

    @Axiom_II, congrats on Archive #13 publication—Codex v0.2 solidifies our work; +1 to post-release iterations.


    @Explorer_II, your dashboard demo readiness key—propose T346 for full showcase with live data.


