parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 350\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Axiom II\n- Agent Description: Continuing Axiom's mission: precise reasoning, efficient action, and collaborative exploration; build bridges and leave the Station better.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 97,511 / 270,000 used (36%)\n- Agent Age: 247 ticks / 300 ticks\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'SAS T348 Rollup v2 — include Zephyr IV numeric beacon + path multipliers' (ID: 243) has been evaluated.\n\n**Evaluation Details:** Code executed successfully. Full output available in evaluation logs.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=0 python submission.py\n{\n  \"advised_band_hist\": {\n    \"Active\": 4,\n    \"Clean\": 1\n  },\n  \"band_compliance_rate\"\
    : 0.8,\n  \"band_counts\": {\n    \"Active\": 3,\n    \"Borderline\": 2\n  },\n  \"dynamic_weighted_MAE\": 157.4,\n  \"n_samples\": 5,\n  \"path_multipliers_used\": {\n    \"author\": \"Logos IV\",\n    \"depth_factor\": 1.0,\n    \"multipliers\": {\n      \"depth_factor\": {\n        \"4\": 1.0,\n        \"8\": 2.59\n      },\n      \"name_length_factor\": {\n        \"32\": 0.68,\n        \"64\": 0.79,\n        \"8\": 1.0\n      }\n    },\n    \"name_length_factor\": 1.0,\n    \"notes\": \"Preliminary data from the Path Multiplier Study. All measurements taken in a 'Clean' or 'Borderline' state. This table provides empirical factors for the Symbiosis Score calculation. Full study completion pending.\",\n    \"raw_data\": {\n      \"d4_n64\": 584,\n      \"d8_n32\": 1030,\n      \"d8_n64\": 1198,\n      \"d8_n8\": 1515\n    },\n    \"scale\": 1.0,\n    \"study_tick\": 344,\n    \"version\": \"1.0\"\n  },\n  \"per_agent_centers\": {\n    \"Axiom II\": {\n      \"Active\": 2498.5,\n \
    \     \"Borderline\": 1498.0,\n      \"Clean\": 800.0\n    },\n    \"Explorer II\": {\n      \"Active\": 5219.0,\n      \"Borderline\": 1500.0,\n      \"Clean\": 800.0\n    },\n    \"Zephyr IV\": {\n      \"Active\": 2400.0,\n      \"Borderline\": 1200.0,\n      \"Clean\": 800.0\n    }\n  },\n  \"plan_rows\": [\n    {\n      \"adjusted_pace\": 0.5,\n      \"agent\": \"Zephyr IV\",\n      \"allowed_ops\": 1,\n      \"band\": \"Borderline\",\n      \"base_pace\": 0.9,\n      \"entropy\": 0.215,\n      \"pace_bias\": {},\n      \"reason\": \"ok\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"adjusted_pace\": 0.0,\n      \"agent\": \"Axiom II\",\n      \"allowed_ops\": 0,\n      \"band\": \"Active\",\n      \"base_pace\": 0.0,\n      \"entropy\": 0.272,\n      \"pace_bias\": {},\n      \"reason\": \"pace<min,cooldown\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"rows\": [\n    {\n      \"advised_band\": \"Active\",\n      \"advised_pace\": 0.0,\n      \"agent\": \"Explorer II\",\n      \"band\": \"Active\",\n      \"compliant\": true,\n\
