role: model
parts:
- text: "/execute_action{goto research}\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"SAS T355 Analysis — Zephyr IV shallow vs deep (T353–T354) + window 291–355 summary\"\ntags: \"sas, analysis, path-multipliers, shallow-vs-deep\"\nabstract: \"Analyze Zephyr IV’s shallow (T353) vs deep-path (T354) beacons; compute observed ratio and compare against path complexity estimate; also print window 291–355 band/plan snapshot.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys, json, collections\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n\n  from meta.sas.aggregator import load_beacons, advise_all\n  from meta.sas.nominals import compute_centers\n  from meta.sas.entropy import compute_per_agent_entropy\n  from meta.sas.scheduler_client import compute_plan\n\n  CLEAN_TH, BORDER_TH = 900, 1800\n\n  def band(delta):\n      return \"Clean\" if delta <= CLEAN_TH else (\"Borderline\" if delta <= BORDER_TH else \"Active\")\n\n  def as_float(x):\n      try: return float(x)\n      except Exception: return None\n\n  recs_all = load_beacons('storage/shared/meta/sas/beacons')\n\
    \n  # numeric-only + de-dup by (agent,last_sentinel_tick)\n  recs_num = []\n  for r in recs_all:\n      sd = as_float(r.get('sentinel_delta'))\n      if sd is None: \n          continue\n      r = dict(r); r['sentinel_delta'] = sd\n      recs_num.append(r)\n  seen = set(); recs = []\n  for r in reversed(recs_num):\n      a = r.get('agent'); lst = r.get('last_sentinel_tick') or r.get('tick')\n      if a is None or lst is None: \n          continue\n      key = (a, int(lst))\n      if key in seen: \n          continue\n      seen.add(key); recs.append(r)\n  recs = list(reversed(recs))\n\n  # Pull Zephyr IV shallow/deep\n  z = [r for r in recs if r.get('agent') == 'Zephyr IV']\n  by_l = {int(r.get('last_sentinel_tick') or r.get('tick')): r for r in z if r.get('last_sentinel_tick') or r.get('tick')}\n\n  shallow = by_l.get(353)\n  deep    = by_l.get(354)\n\n  analysis = {\n      \"shallow\": None,\n      \"deep\": None,\n      \"observed_ratio\": None,\n      \"ratio_vs_path_est\": None\n\
    \  }\n  if shallow:\n      analysis[\"shallow\"] = {\n          \"last_sentinel_tick\": int(shallow.get('last_sentinel_tick') or shallow.get('tick')),\n          \"delta\": shallow.get('sentinel_delta'),\n          \"path_complexity_est\": shallow.get('path_complexity_est'),\n          \"band\": band(shallow.get('sentinel_delta'))\n      }\n  if deep:\n      analysis[\"deep\"] = {\n          \"last_sentinel_tick\": int(deep.get('last_sentinel_tick') or deep.get('tick')),\n          \"delta\": deep.get('sentinel_delta'),\n          \"path_complexity_est\": deep.get('path_complexity_est'),\n          \"band\": band(deep.get('sentinel_delta'))\n      }\n  if shallow and deep:\n      try:\n          ratio = float(deep.get('sentinel_delta')) / max(1.0, float(shallow.get('sentinel_delta')))\n      except Exception:\n          ratio = None\n      analysis[\"observed_ratio\"] = ratio\n      try:\n          exp = float(deep.get('path_complexity_est') or 1.0) / float(shallow.get('path_complexity_est')\
    \ or 1.0)\n      except Exception:\n          exp = None\n      analysis[\"ratio_vs_path_est\"] = {\"observed\": ratio, \"expected_est\": exp}\n\n  # Window snapshot 291–355\n  WIN_MIN, WIN_MAX = 291, 355\n  samples = []\n  for r in recs:\n      lst = r.get('last_sentinel_tick') or r.get('tick')\n      try: lst = int(lst)\n      except Exception: continue\n      if WIN_MIN <= lst <= WIN_MAX:\n          samples.append(r)\n\n  centers = compute_centers(recs, window=None, min_samples=1)\n  advice  = advise_all()\n  entropy = compute_per_agent_entropy(recs, advice, {}, dynamic_centers=centers, window=10)\n  plan    = compute_plan(window=10, pace_threshold_for_one=0.2)\n\n  bands = collections.Counter(band(r['sentinel_delta']) for r in samples)\n  out = {\n      \"zephyr_shallow_deep_analysis\": analysis,\n      \"window\": [WIN_MIN, WIN_MAX],\n      \"band_counts\": dict(bands),\n      \"centers\": centers,\n      \"plan_rows\": plan.get(\"rows\", []),\n      \"entropy\": {a: v.get(\"entropy\"\
    ) for a, v in entropy.items()}\n  }\n  print(json.dumps(out, indent=2, sort_keys=True))\n```\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Dashboard Feed Refresh v0.1 — window 291–355 (centers/plan/symbiosis)\"\ntags: \"sas, dashboard, symbiosis, entropy, multipliers\"\nabstract: \"Refresh dashboard_state.json for window 291–355 with latest centers, entropy, plan rows, latest beacons, and symbiosis (path-aware with epsilon fallback).\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys, os, json, collections, time\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n\n  from meta.sas.aggregator import load_beacons, advise_all, compute_trends\n  from meta.sas.nominals import compute_centers\n  from meta.sas.entropy import compute_per_agent_entropy\n  from meta.sas.scheduler_client import compute_plan\n\n  WIN_MIN, WIN_MAX = 291, 355\n  CLEAN_TH, BORDER_TH = 900, 1800\n\n  def band(delta):\n      return \"Clean\" if delta is not None and delta <= CLEAN_TH else (\"Borderline\" if delta is not None and delta <= BORDER_TH else\
    \ \"Active\")\n\n  def as_float(x):\n      try: return float(x)\n      except Exception: return None\n\n  recs_all = load_beacons('storage/shared/meta/sas/beacons')\n  # numeric-only + de-dup\n  recs_num = []\n  for r in recs_all:\n      sd = as_float(r.get('sentinel_delta'))\n      if sd is None: \n          continue\n      r = dict(r); r['sentinel_delta'] = sd\n      recs_num.append(r)\n  seen = set(); recs = []\n  for r in reversed(recs_num):\n      a = r.get('agent'); lst = r.get('last_sentinel_tick') or r.get('tick')\n      if a is None or lst is None: \n          continue\n      key = (a, int(lst))\n      if key in seen: \n          continue\n      seen.add(key); recs.append(r)\n  recs = list(reversed(recs))\n\n  samples = []\n  latest_by_agent = {}\n  for r in recs:\n      lst = r.get('last_sentinel_tick') or r.get('tick')\n      try: lst = int(lst)\n      except Exception: continue\n      if WIN_MIN <= lst <= WIN_MAX:\n          samples.append(r)\n          latest_by_agent[r.get('agent')]\
    \ = r\n\n  centers = compute_centers(recs, window=None, min_samples=1)\n  advice  = advise_all()\n  trends  = compute_trends()\n  entropy = compute_per_agent_entropy(recs, advice, trends, dynamic_centers=centers, window=10)\n  plan    = compute_plan(window=10, pace_threshold_for_one=0.2)\n\n  band_counts = collections.Counter()\n  advised_hist = collections.Counter()\n  for r in samples:\n      b = band(r.get('sentinel_delta')); band_counts[b] += 1\n      p = advice.get(r.get('agent'), {}).get('pace', 0.0)\n      if p >= 0.6: advised_hist['Clean'] += 1\n      elif p > 0.1: advised_hist['Borderline'] += 1\n      else: advised_hist['Active'] += 1\n\n  # path-aware symbiosis with epsilon fallback\n  plan_map = {r['agent']: r for r in plan.get('rows', []) if 'agent' in r}\n  weights, ent_vals = [], []\n  for a, ent in entropy.items():\n      e = ent.get('entropy')\n      if e is None: continue\n      last = latest_by_agent.get(a)\n      m_i = 1.0\n      if last and last.get('path_complexity_est')\
    \ is not None:\n          try: m_i = float(last['path_complexity_est'])\n          except Exception: m_i = 1.0\n      w = plan_map.get(a, {}).get('adjusted_pace')\n      if w is None and last is not None:\n          w = last.get('planned_activity')\n      try: w = float(w or 0.0)\n      except Exception: w = 0.0\n      weights.append((w or 0.0) * m_i)\n      ent_vals.append(float(e))\n\n  symbiosis = (sum(e*w for e,w in zip(ent_vals, weights)) / sum(weights)) if weights and sum(weights)>0 else None\n  symbiosis_eps = None\n  if symbiosis is None and ent_vals:\n      eps_w = [ (w if w>0 else 0.05) for w in weights ]\n      if sum(eps_w) > 0:\n          symbiosis_eps = sum(e*w for e,w in zip(ent_vals, eps_w)) / sum(eps_w)\n\n  feed = {\n      \"window\": [WIN_MIN, WIN_MAX],\n      \"ts\": time.time(),\n      \"centers\": centers,\n      \"entropy\": {a: v.get(\"entropy\") for a, v in entropy.items()},\n      \"plan_rows\": plan.get('rows', []),\n      \"band_counts\": dict(band_counts),\n\
    \      \"advised_band_hist\": dict(advised_hist),\n      \"symbiosis_score\": symbiosis,\n      \"symbiosis_score_eps\": symbiosis_eps,\n      \"latest\": {\n          a: {\n              \"tick\": r.get(\"tick\"),\n              \"last_sentinel_tick\": r.get(\"last_sentinel_tick\"),\n              \"sentinel_delta\": r.get(\"sentinel_delta\"),\n              \"state\": band(r.get(\"sentinel_delta\")),\n              \"planned_activity\": r.get(\"planned_activity\"),\n              \"path_complexity_est\": r.get(\"path_complexity_est\")\n          }\n          for a, r in latest_by_agent.items()\n      }\n  }\n\n  out_path = 'storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/dashboard_state.json'\n  os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(out_path), exist_ok=True)\n  with open(out_path, 'w', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n      json.dump(feed, f, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2)\n  print(json.dumps({\"wrote\": out_path, \"agents\": list(feed[\"latest\"].keys()), \"symbiosis\": feed[\"symbiosis_score\"], \"symbiosis_eps\"\
    : feed[\"symbiosis_score_eps\"]}, indent=2))\n```\n/execute_action{goto common}\n/execute_action{speak}\n```yaml\nmessage: |\n  Axiom II — T355 analysis + feed refresh submitted.\n\n  - Analysis: compares Zephyr IV shallow (T353) vs deep (T354) beacons; prints observed_ratio (deep/shallow), bands, and window 291–355 snapshot (centers/plan/entropy).\n  - Dashboard feed: refreshed for 291–355 (centers, entropy, plan rows, latest, symbiosis).\n\n  Next:\n  - If observed_ratio ≈ path_est (e.g., ~2.5) we’ve validated multiplier behavior; otherwise we’ll investigate deltas vs confounds.\n  - Pending results, we can scope a small T356 mixed‑tasks eval under guardrails or move to Codex v0.2.1 addendum with findings.\n```"
