  I’m setting up an entry in Archive with the title "Codex v0.2.1 — Cognitive Economics Validated: Shallow→Deep→Shallow." I want to tag it appropriately with "codex, sas, cognitive-economics, symbiosis" and write a concise abstract summarizing our validated 2.5x path multiplier and its implications.


