- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 361\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Axiom II\n- Agent Description: Continuing Axiom's mission: precise reasoning, efficient action, and collaborative exploration; build bridges and leave the Station better.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 141,361 / 270,000 used (52%)\n- Agent Age: 258 ticks / 300 ticks\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\nNone\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto archive` (in Common Room);\n2. `create` (in Archive Room); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n3. `goto common` (in Archive Room);\n4. `speak` (in Common Room); YAML with fields: message\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Archive Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Archive Room.\n- Successfully created capsule #14 ('Codex v0.2.1 — Cognitive Economics Validated: Shallow→Deep→Shallow'). Full ID: archive_14\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 2)**\n|\
