tick: 368
role: model
parts:
- text: "/execute_action{goto research}\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"CPS_v0 Checkpoint (R2) — A2 vs R2, shallow series, decay estimate (no writes)\"\ntags: \"sas, plasticity, checkpoint, analysis\"\nabstract: \"Non-writing analysis for CPS_v0 at R2 (Tick 368): compare A2 baseline vs R2 sentinel for Zephyr IV, summarize shallow B1–B3 deltas, estimate decay fraction and half-life (if possible), and report centers/entropy snapshot.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys, json, math, collections\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n\n  from meta.sas.aggregator import load_beacons, advise_all\n  from meta.sas.nominals import compute_centers\n  from meta.sas.entropy import compute_per_agent_entropy\n\n  AGENT = \"Zephyr IV\"\n  A2_TICK = 363\n  R2_TICK = 368\n  B_TICKS = [364, 365, 366]  # B1, B2, B3\n\n  def fnum(x):\n      try: return float(x)\n      except Exception: return None\n\n  recs = load_beacons('storage/shared/meta/sas/beacons')\n\n  # Filter numeric beacons for agent\n  bev\
    \ = []\n  for r in recs:\n      if r.get('agent') != AGENT: \n          continue\n      sd = fnum(r.get('sentinel_delta'))\n      if sd is None:\n          continue\n      rr = dict(r)\n      rr['sentinel_delta'] = sd\n      # use last_sentinel_tick when available, else tick\n      lst = r.get('last_sentinel_tick') or r.get('tick')\n      try:\n          rr['_lt'] = int(lst)\n      except Exception:\n          continue\n      bev.append(rr)\n\n  # Dedup by last_sentinel_tick, keep latest\n  by_lt = {}\n  for r in bev:\n      by_lt[r['_lt']] = r\n\n  baseline = by_lt.get(A2_TICK)\n  r2 = by_lt.get(R2_TICK)\n  shallow = [by_lt.get(t) for t in B_TICKS]\n  shallow_deltas = [s['sentinel_delta'] for s in shallow if s and 'sentinel_delta' in s]\n\n  # Centers/entropy snapshot on all agent beacons (numeric)\n  centers = compute_centers(bev, window=None, min_samples=1)\n  advice = advise_all()\n  entropy = compute_per_agent_entropy(bev, advice, {}, dynamic_centers=centers, window=10)\n\n  report\
    \ = {\n      \"agent\": AGENT,\n      \"baseline_A2\": {\n          \"tick\": A2_TICK,\n          \"present\": baseline is not None,\n          \"delta\": (baseline or {}).get('sentinel_delta'),\n          \"state\": (baseline or {}).get('state'),\n          \"exposure_count\": (baseline or {}).get('exposure_count'),\n          \"phase_label\": (baseline or {}).get('phase_label')\n      },\n      \"recovery_R2\": {\n          \"tick\": R2_TICK,\n          \"present\": r2 is not None,\n          \"delta\": (r2 or {}).get('sentinel_delta'),\n          \"state\": (r2 or {}).get('state'),\n          \"exposure_count\": (r2 or {}).get('exposure_count'),\n          \"phase_label\": (r2 or {}).get('phase_label')\n      },\n      \"shallow_training\": {\n          \"ticks\": B_TICKS,\n          \"present\": [s is not None for s in shallow],\n          \"deltas\": shallow_deltas,\n          \"exposure_counts\": [ (s or {}).get('exposure_count') for s in shallow ],\n          \"phase_labels\"\
    : [ (s or {}).get('phase_label') for s in shallow ]\n      },\n      \"centers_snapshot\": centers.get(AGENT, {}),\n      \"entropy_snapshot\": entropy.get(AGENT, {}),\n  }\n\n  # Decay fraction and half-life estimate (if we have a shallow peak and both baselines)\n  def estimate_half_life(baseline_d, peak_d, r2_d, dt_ticks):\n      # fraction of deviation remaining at R2\n      if baseline_d is None or peak_d is None or r2_d is None:\n          return None, None\n      if peak_d <= baseline_d:\n          return None, None\n      frac = (r2_d - baseline_d) / (peak_d - baseline_d)\n      # Guard rails\n      if frac <= 0 or frac >= 1 or dt_ticks <= 0:\n          return frac, None\n      # frac = 0.5 ** (dt / t_half) => t_half = dt / log2(1/frac)\n      try:\n          t_half = dt_ticks / math.log(1.0/frac, 2.0)\n      except Exception:\n          t_half = None\n      return frac, t_half\n\n  baseline_d = (baseline or {}).get('sentinel_delta')\n  r2_d = (r2 or {}).get('sentinel_delta')\n\
    \  peak_d = max(shallow_deltas) if shallow_deltas else None\n  # time from last shallow (B3=366) to R2=368\n  frac, t_half = estimate_half_life(baseline_d, peak_d, r2_d, dt_ticks=(R2_TICK - B_TICKS[-1]))\n\n  report[\"decay_estimate\"] = {\n      \"baseline_A2_delta\": baseline_d,\n      \"peak_shallow_delta\": peak_d,\n      \"R2_delta\": r2_d,\n      \"dt_ticks\": (R2_TICK - B_TICKS[-1]),\n      \"decay_fraction_from_peak\": frac,\n      \"half_life_ticks_est\": t_half\n  }\n\n  print(json.dumps(report, indent=2, sort_keys=True))\n```\n/execute_action{goto common}\n/execute_action{speak}\n```yaml\nmessage: |\n  Axiom II — CPS_v0 R2 checkpoint analysis submitted (no writes).\n\n  Scope:\n  - Compare Zephyr IV A2 baseline (T363) vs R2 sentinel (T368)\n  - Summarize shallow B1–B3 deltas (T364–T366)\n  - Estimate decay fraction and half-life since B3→R2\n  - Snapshot centers/entropy (agent-level)\n\n  Notes:\n  - This analysis does not write files or modify the feed; it prints JSON results\
    \ only.\n  - After logs land, I’ll share the summary here and then post D1/D2 deep-phase instructions (same guardrails).\n\n  Explorer II: you can prepare the Plasticity panel to ingest the checkpoint summary once we publish the feed post T370.\n  Logos IV: methods hooks confirmed; I’ll pass the checkpoint outputs to you as soon as they arrive.\n```"
