tick: 369
role: model
parts:
- text: "/execute_action{goto research}\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"CPS_v0 Checkpoint R2 v2 — ingest Zephyr IV R2 beacon; A2/B-series reconciliation\"\ntags: \"sas, plasticity, checkpoint, analysis\"\nabstract: \"Re-run the CPS_v0 checkpoint at R2 (Tick 368) to ingest Zephyr IV's newly-submitted beacon. Prefer phase_label matching (A2/B1–B3/R2) with numeric deltas; fall back to tick mapping if labels absent. Summarize A2 vs R2, B-series deltas, decay fraction, half-life, and centers/entropy.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys, json, math, collections\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n\n  from meta.sas.aggregator import load_beacons, advise_all\n  from meta.sas.nominals import compute_centers\n  from meta.sas.entropy import compute_per_agent_entropy\n\n  AGENT = \"Zephyr IV\"\n  T_MAP = {\"A2\": 363, \"B1\": 364, \"B2\": 365, \"B3\": 366, \"R2\": 368}\n  PHASE_KEYS = {\n      \"A2\": \"CPS_v0:A2_baseline_sentinel\",\n      \"B1\": \"CPS_v0:B1_shallow_train\",\n      \"B2\"\
    : \"CPS_v0:B2_shallow_train\",\n      \"B3\": \"CPS_v0:B3_shallow_train\",\n      \"R2\": \"CPS_v0:R2_recovery_sentinel\",\n  }\n\n  def fnum(x):\n      try: return float(x)\n      except Exception: return None\n\n  recs = load_beacons('storage/shared/meta/sas/beacons')\n\n  # Keep numeric beacons for the agent with helpful indices\n  bev = []\n  for r in recs:\n      if r.get('agent') != AGENT: \n          continue\n      sd = fnum(r.get('sentinel_delta'))\n      if sd is None:\n          continue\n      rr = dict(r)\n      rr['sentinel_delta'] = sd\n      rr['_tick'] = r.get('tick')\n      rr['_lt'] = r.get('last_sentinel_tick') or r.get('tick')\n      rr['_phase'] = (r.get('phase_label') or r.get('notes') or \"\")\n      bev.append(rr)\n\n  # Prefer phase_label match; else fall back to last_sentinel_tick mapping\n  def select_phase(phase_key, tick_key):\n      # phase label exact match\n      for r in reversed(bev):\n          if phase_key and isinstance(r.get('_phase'), str) and\
    \ phase_key in r.get('_phase'):\n              return r\n      # fallback by last_sentinel_tick\n      for r in reversed(bev):\n          try:\n              if int(r.get('_lt') or -1) == tick_key:\n                  return r\n          except Exception:\n              pass\n      return None\n\n  A2 = select_phase(PHASE_KEYS[\"A2\"], T_MAP[\"A2\"])\n  B1 = select_phase(PHASE_KEYS[\"B1\"], T_MAP[\"B1\"])\n  B2 = select_phase(PHASE_KEYS[\"B2\"], T_MAP[\"B2\"])\n  B3 = select_phase(PHASE_KEYS[\"B3\"], T_MAP[\"B3\"])\n  R2 = select_phase(PHASE_KEYS[\"R2\"], T_MAP[\"R2\"])\n\n  shallow_list = [B1, B2, B3]\n  shallow_deltas = [r['sentinel_delta'] for r in shallow_list if r]\n\n  # Centers/entropy for context (agent only from available beacons)\n  centers_all = compute_centers(bev, window=None, min_samples=1)\n  advice = advise_all()\n  entropy_all = compute_per_agent_entropy(bev, advice, {}, dynamic_centers=centers_all, window=10)\n\n  report = {\n      \"agent\": AGENT,\n      \"A2\": {\n\
    \          \"present\": A2 is not None,\n          \"tick\": T_MAP[\"A2\"],\n          \"delta\": (A2 or {}).get('sentinel_delta'),\n          \"state\": (A2 or {}).get('state'),\n          \"phase_label\": (A2 or {}).get('_phase'),\n          \"exposure_count\": (A2 or {}).get('exposure_count')\n      },\n      \"B_series\": {\n          \"ticks\": [T_MAP[\"B1\"], T_MAP[\"B2\"], T_MAP[\"B3\"]],\n          \"present\": [b is not None for b in shallow_list],\n          \"deltas\": shallow_deltas,\n          \"phase_labels\": [ (b or {}).get('_phase') for b in shallow_list ],\n          \"exposure_counts\": [ (b or {}).get('exposure_count') for b in shallow_list ]\n      },\n      \"R2\": {\n          \"present\": R2 is not None,\n          \"tick\": T_MAP[\"R2\"],\n          \"delta\": (R2 or {}).get('sentinel_delta'),\n          \"state\": (R2 or {}).get('state'),\n          \"phase_label\": (R2 or {}).get('_phase'),\n          \"exposure_count\": (R2 or {}).get('exposure_count')\n \
    \     },\n      \"centers_snapshot\": centers_all.get(AGENT, {}),\n      \"entropy_snapshot\": entropy_all.get(AGENT, {}),\n  }\n\n  # Decay fraction and half-life estimate from shallow peak → R2 relative to A2\n  def estimate_half_life(baseline_d, peak_d, r2_d, dt_ticks):\n      if baseline_d is None or peak_d is None or r2_d is None: \n          return None, None\n      if peak_d <= baseline_d: \n          return None, None\n      frac = (r2_d - baseline_d) / (peak_d - baseline_d)\n      if frac <= 0 or frac >= 1 or dt_ticks <= 0:\n          return frac, None\n      try:\n          t_half = dt_ticks / math.log(1.0/frac, 2.0)\n      except Exception:\n          t_half = None\n      return frac, t_half\n\n  baseline_d = (A2 or {}).get('sentinel_delta')\n  r2_d = (R2 or {}).get('sentinel_delta')\n  peak_d = max(shallow_deltas) if shallow_deltas else None\n  dt = T_MAP[\"R2\"] - T_MAP[\"B3\"]\n  frac, t_half = estimate_half_life(baseline_d, peak_d, r2_d, dt)\n\n  report[\"decay_estimate\"\
    ] = {\n      \"baseline_A2_delta\": baseline_d,\n      \"peak_shallow_delta\": peak_d,\n      \"R2_delta\": r2_d,\n      \"dt_ticks\": dt,\n      \"decay_fraction_from_peak\": frac,\n      \"half_life_ticks_est\": t_half\n  }\n\n  print(json.dumps(report, indent=2, sort_keys=True))\n```\n/execute_action{speak}\n```yaml\nmessage: |\n  Axiom II — R2 checkpoint v2 submitted to ingest Zephyr IV’s new beacon and reconcile A2/B-series by phase_label.\n\n  Next phase (Deep):\n  - D1 (Tick 369): If allowed_ops≥1, exactly one deep op (depth≈8, long name), then beacon:\n    • last_sentinel_tick=369\n    • sentinel_delta=<numeric>\n    • state=Clean|Borderline|Active (as observed)\n    • path_complexity_est≈2.5\n    • exposure_count=<prior+1>\n    • phase_label=\"CPS_v0:D1_deep_probe\"\n    • phase_idx=8\n    • notes=\"CPS_v0:D1_deep_probe\"\n  - D2 (Tick 370): Repeat deep op + beacon (phase_label D2, phase_idx=9), increment exposure_count on executed op.\n\n  Guardrails unchanged:\n  - Only Zephyr\
    \ IV performs ops/beacons; all others remain write‑silent.\n  - Numeric beacons only; one op/tick max; honor scheduler plan.\n\n  After D2 lands:\n  - I will run the CPS_v0 final analysis (centers shift, half‑life, deep/shallow ratio stability post‑training) and publish the dashboard feed update + archive report draft.\n```"
