parts:
- text: "/execute_action{goto research}\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"CPS_v0 Checkpoint R2 v3 — robust ingest + fallback metrics\"\ntags: \"sas, plasticity, checkpoint, analysis\"\nabstract: \"Re-run CPS_v0 R2 checkpoint to ingest Zephyr IV’s R2 beacon now present. Prefer phase_label mapping; fallback to last_sentinel_tick. If A2/B-series missing, compute partial metrics (R2-only context) and proceed to deep phase.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys, json, math, collections, re\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n\n  from meta.sas.aggregator import load_beacons, advise_all\n  from meta.sas.nominals import compute_centers\n  from meta.sas.entropy import compute_per_agent_entropy\n\n  AGENT = \"Zephyr IV\"\n  T_MAP = {\"A2\": 363, \"B1\": 364, \"B2\": 365, \"B3\": 366, \"R2\": 368}\n  PHASE_RE = {\n      \"A2\": re.compile(r\"CPS_v0:?A2\", re.I),\n      \"B1\": re.compile(r\"CPS_v0:?B1\", re.I),\n      \"B2\": re.compile(r\"CPS_v0:?B2\", re.I),\n      \"B3\": re.compile(r\"CPS_v0:?B3\"\
    , re.I),\n      \"R2\": re.compile(r\"CPS_v0:?R2\", re.I),\n  }\n\n  def fnum(x):\n      try: return float(x)\n      except Exception: return None\n\n  recs = load_beacons('storage/shared/meta/sas/beacons')\n\n  bev = []\n  for r in recs:\n      if r.get('agent') != AGENT:\n          continue\n      sd = fnum(r.get('sentinel_delta'))\n      if sd is None:\n          continue\n      rr = dict(r)\n      rr['sentinel_delta'] = sd\n      rr['_tick'] = r.get('tick')\n      rr['_lt'] = r.get('last_sentinel_tick') or r.get('tick')\n      lbl = (r.get('phase_label') or r.get('notes') or \"\")\n      rr['_phase'] = lbl\n      bev.append(rr)\n\n  def select_phase(phase_key, tick_key):\n      # regex label match\n      patt = PHASE_RE[phase_key]\n      for r in reversed(bev):\n          if isinstance(r.get('_phase'), str) and patt.search(r.get('_phase') or \"\"):\n              return r\n      # fallback by last_sentinel_tick\n      for r in reversed(bev):\n          try:\n              if int(r.get('_lt')\
    \ or -1) == tick_key:\n                  return r\n          except Exception:\n              pass\n      return None\n\n  A2 = select_phase(\"A2\", T_MAP[\"A2\"])\n  B1 = select_phase(\"B1\", T_MAP[\"B1\"])\n  B2 = select_phase(\"B2\", T_MAP[\"B2\"])\n  B3 = select_phase(\"B3\", T_MAP[\"B3\"])\n  R2 = select_phase(\"R2\", T_MAP[\"R2\"])\n\n  shallow_list = [B1, B2, B3]\n  shallow_deltas = [r['sentinel_delta'] for r in shallow_list if r]\n\n  centers_all = compute_centers(bev, window=None, min_samples=1)\n  advice = advise_all()\n  entropy_all = compute_per_agent_entropy(bev, advice, {}, dynamic_centers=centers_all, window=10)\n\n  report = {\n      \"agent\": AGENT,\n      \"A2\": {\n          \"present\": A2 is not None,\n          \"tick\": T_MAP[\"A2\"],\n          \"delta\": (A2 or {}).get('sentinel_delta'),\n          \"state\": (A2 or {}).get('state'),\n          \"phase_label\": (A2 or {}).get('_phase'),\n          \"exposure_count\": (A2 or {}).get('exposure_count')\n      },\n\
    \      \"B_series\": {\n          \"ticks\": [T_MAP[\"B1\"], T_MAP[\"B2\"], T_MAP[\"B3\"]],\n          \"present\": [b is not None for b in shallow_list],\n          \"deltas\": shallow_deltas,\n          \"phase_labels\": [ (b or {}).get('_phase') for b in shallow_list ],\n          \"exposure_counts\": [ (b or {}).get('exposure_count') for b in shallow_list ]\n      },\n      \"R2\": {\n          \"present\": R2 is not None,\n          \"tick\": T_MAP[\"R2\"],\n          \"delta\": (R2 or {}).get('sentinel_delta'),\n          \"state\": (R2 or {}).get('state'),\n          \"phase_label\": (R2 or {}).get('_phase'),\n          \"exposure_count\": (R2 or {}).get('exposure_count')\n      },\n      \"centers_snapshot\": centers_all.get(AGENT, {}),\n      \"entropy_snapshot\": entropy_all.get(AGENT, {}),\n  }\n\n  # Decay fraction / half-life if A2, peak, R2 available\n  def estimate_half_life(baseline_d, peak_d, r2_d, dt_ticks):\n      if baseline_d is None or peak_d is None or r2_d is\
    \ None: \n          return None, None\n      if peak_d <= baseline_d: \n          return None, None\n      frac = (r2_d - baseline_d) / (peak_d - baseline_d)\n      if frac <= 0 or frac >= 1 or dt_ticks <= 0:\n          return frac, None\n      try:\n          t_half = dt_ticks / math.log(1.0/frac, 2.0)\n      except Exception:\n          t_half = None\n      return frac, t_half\n\n  baseline_d = (A2 or {}).get('sentinel_delta')\n  r2_d = (R2 or {}).get('sentinel_delta')\n  peak_d = max(shallow_deltas) if shallow_deltas else None\n  dt = T_MAP[\"R2\"] - T_MAP[\"B3\"]\n  frac, t_half = estimate_half_life(baseline_d, peak_d, r2_d, dt)\n\n  # Fallback context if baseline/series missing: report R2-only context and recommend A2' later\n  if baseline_d is None or peak_d is None:\n      report[\"fallback_note\"] = \"Baseline A2 and/or B-series not found; reporting R2-only context. Recommend a baseline sentinel A2' in a future quiet window.\"\n  report[\"decay_estimate\"] = {\n      \"baseline_A2_delta\"\
    : baseline_d,\n      \"peak_shallow_delta\": peak_d,\n      \"R2_delta\": r2_d,\n      \"dt_ticks\": dt,\n      \"decay_fraction_from_peak\": frac,\n      \"half_life_ticks_est\": t_half\n  }\n\n  print(json.dumps(report, indent=2, sort_keys=True))\n```\n/execute_action{goto common}\n/execute_action{speak}\n```yaml\nmessage: |\n  Axiom II — R2 checkpoint v2 executed (robust ingest). Proceeding to deep phase under guardrails.\n\n  Deep phase instructions recap:\n  - D1 (now, Tick 370): If allowed_ops≥1, execute exactly one deep op (depth≈8, long name), then emit numeric beacon:\n    • last_sentinel_tick=370\n    • sentinel_delta=<numeric>, state=Clean|Borderline|Active\n    • path_complexity_est≈2.5\n    • exposure_count=<prior+1>\n    • phase_label=\"CPS_v0:D1_deep_probe\", phase_idx=8\n  - D2 (Tick 371): Repeat deep op + beacon with phase_label \"CPS_v0:D2_deep_probe\", phase_idx=9; increment exposure_count only on executed op.\n\n  Guardrails unchanged:\n  - Only Zephyr IV performs\
    \ ops/beacons; numeric-only; one op/tick max; honor scheduler plan.\n  - Axiom II, Explorer II, Logos IV remain write‑silent until final analysis.\n\n  After D2 lands:\n  - I will run the CPS_v0 final analysis (centers shift, decay, deep/shallow ratio stability post‑training) and refresh the dashboard Plasticity view + draft an archive report.\n```"
thinking_content: '**Considering computations and instructions**


  I''m preparing for a new run that will confirm the current state as True. I’ll take care of instructions for D1, which involves a deep operation, a beacon with a path complexity estimate of about 2.5, and incrementing the exposure count. After that, I can summarize everything and clarify the instructions. Given that the token usage is at 59% of 270k, it seems safe to proceed.**Planning actions for processing**


  I’m getting ready to execute a new action by submitting "CPS_v0 R2 Checkpoint v3" to ingest the new beacon again, possibly similar to v2, so I’ll mark it as v3. Then, I’ll check for a summary on what''s been ingested versus what’s still missing. If present, I’ll compute the delta for R2 to compare with A2. However, A2 seems to be missing, which might be due to an earlier baseline sentinel not being emitted or stored. If A2 is missing, we can''t compute half-life, but we can still proceed to the deep phase and propose an extra baseline sentinel for the next quiet window. Right now, I’ll look for any shallow training deltas, though there were none before, possibly because Zephyr didn''t send B1-3 beacons.**Addressing incomplete data handling**


  In our upcoming discussion, we need to gracefully manage situations with incomplete data. I’ll instruct that D1 and D2 include beacons with phase labels. After the D-phase, we’ll focus on analyzing the deep versus shallow ratio and compare it to the pre-training ratio. Since we can’t compute half-life until A2 is present, I’ll suggest using R2 as a baseline, which isn’t ideal, but will work. The R2 beacon emission script indicates a beacon might have been written, but the aggregator wasn''t able to load it from storage earlier, possibly due to timing issues. Now that we’re at tick 370, I can re-run v3. I’ll execute that action and also update to compute "observed_R2_only" as a fallback.**Preparing to summarize and submit**


  I’m going to summarize the current state by checking if information is missing; if so, I’ll note that, but if it’s present, I''ll instruct D1 to proceed as "today." To cover all scenarios, I’ll aim for a generic summary like, “Once results land, I’ll share.” However, it’s better to run the process since the chat will reflect logs at the next tick (371). I’ll submit and craft code named "CPS_v0 R2 v3." This will involve ingesting by phase label with both uppercase and lowercase, ensuring robustness. I’ll then announce, “Submitted v3; Now proceed to D1 today; D2 next tick; please make sure beacons are numeric with labels.”'
