tick: 371
role: model
parts:
- text: "/execute_action{goto research}\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"CPS_v0 Final (v1) — Plasticity analysis + dashboard plasticity block (A2/R2/D1/D2)\"\ntags: \"sas, plasticity, analysis, dashboard\"\nabstract: \"Compute CPS_v0 plasticity metrics for Zephyr IV across phases A2/R2/D1/D2 using phase labels or tick fallback. Report deltas, deep/shallow ratios (post-training), centers/entropy, and write a 'plasticity' block into the dashboard feed. Robust to missing D2 (partial results).\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys, os, json, re, time\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n\n  from meta.sas.aggregator import load_beacons, advise_all\n  from meta.sas.nominals import compute_centers\n  from meta.sas.entropy import compute_per_agent_entropy\n\n  AGENT = \"Zephyr IV\"\n  TICK_MAP = {\"A2\": 363, \"B1\": 364, \"B2\": 365, \"B3\": 366, \"R2\": 368, \"D1\": 370, \"D2\": 371}\n  PHASE_RE = {\n      \"A2\": re.compile(r\"CPS_v0:?A2\", re.I),\n      \"B1\": re.compile(r\"CPS_v0:?B1\"\
    , re.I),\n      \"B2\": re.compile(r\"CPS_v0:?B2\", re.I),\n      \"B3\": re.compile(r\"CPS_v0:?B3\", re.I),\n      \"R2\": re.compile(r\"CPS_v0:?R2\", re.I),\n      \"D1\": re.compile(r\"CPS_v0:?D1\", re.I),\n      \"D2\": re.compile(r\"CPS_v0:?D2\", re.I),\n  }\n\n  def fnum(x):\n      try: return float(x)\n      except Exception: return None\n\n  recs_all = load_beacons('storage/shared/meta/sas/beacons')\n  recs = []\n  for r in recs_all:\n      if r.get('agent') != AGENT: \n          continue\n      sd = fnum(r.get('sentinel_delta'))\n      if sd is None:\n          continue\n      rr = dict(r)\n      rr['sentinel_delta'] = sd\n      rr['_tick'] = r.get('tick')\n      rr['_lt'] = r.get('last_sentinel_tick') or r.get('tick')\n      rr['_phase'] = (r.get('phase_label') or r.get('notes') or \"\")\n      recs.append(rr)\n\n  def select_phase(key):\n      patt = PHASE_RE[key]\n      # prefer explicit label match, newest first\n      for r in reversed(recs):\n          if isinstance(r.get('_phase'),\
    \ str) and patt.search(r['_phase']):\n              return r\n      # fallback by last_sentinel_tick\n      for r in reversed(recs):\n          try:\n              if int(r.get('_lt') or -1) == TICK_MAP[key]:\n                  return r\n          except Exception:\n              pass\n      return None\n\n  A2 = select_phase(\"A2\")\n  R2 = select_phase(\"R2\")\n  D1 = select_phase(\"D1\")\n  D2 = select_phase(\"D2\")\n\n  # Shallow baseline after training: prefer R2 sentinel; fallback to last shallow op beacon if present\n  shallow_baseline = R2\n  # Derive ratios (deep over shallow_baseline)\n  def ratio(deep, shallow):\n      if not deep or not shallow: return None\n      s = fnum(shallow.get('sentinel_delta'))\n      d = fnum(deep.get('sentinel_delta'))\n      if s and s > 0 and d is not None:\n          return d / s\n      return None\n\n  r_d1 = ratio(D1, shallow_baseline)\n  r_d2 = ratio(D2, shallow_baseline)\n\n  # Expected ratios from path_est if present\n  def exp_ratio(deep,\
    \ shallow):\n      if not deep or not shallow: return None\n      try:\n          dpe = float(deep.get('path_complexity_est') or 1.0)\n          spe = float(shallow.get('path_complexity_est') or 1.0)\n          return dpe / (spe if spe else 1.0)\n      except Exception:\n          return None\n\n  e_d1 = exp_ratio(D1, shallow_baseline)\n  e_d2 = exp_ratio(D2, shallow_baseline)\n\n  centers = compute_centers(recs, window=None, min_samples=1)\n  advice = advise_all()\n  entropy = compute_per_agent_entropy(recs, advice, {}, dynamic_centers=centers, window=10)\n\n  summary = {\n      \"agent\": AGENT,\n      \"present\": {\n          \"A2\": A2 is not None,\n          \"R2\": R2 is not None,\n          \"D1\": D1 is not None,\n          \"D2\": D2 is not None\n      },\n      \"A2\": {\n          \"tick\": TICK_MAP[\"A2\"],\n          \"delta\": (A2 or {}).get(\"sentinel_delta\"),\n          \"state\": (A2 or {}).get(\"state\"),\n          \"phase_label\": (A2 or {}).get(\"_phase\")\n  \
    \    },\n      \"R2\": {\n          \"tick\": TICK_MAP[\"R2\"],\n          \"delta\": (R2 or {}).get(\"sentinel_delta\"),\n          \"state\": (R2 or {}).get(\"state\"),\n          \"phase_label\": (R2 or {}).get(\"_phase\")\n      },\n      \"D_phase\": {\n          \"D1\": {\n              \"tick\": TICK_MAP[\"D1\"],\n              \"delta\": (D1 or {}).get(\"sentinel_delta\"),\n              \"state\": (D1 or {}).get(\"state\"),\n              \"phase_label\": (D1 or {}).get(\"_phase\"),\n              \"ratio_deep_over_shallow_R2\": r_d1,\n              \"expected_ratio\": e_d1\n          },\n          \"D2\": {\n              \"tick\": TICK_MAP[\"D2\"],\n              \"delta\": (D2 or {}).get(\"sentinel_delta\"),\n              \"state\": (D2 or {}).get(\"state\"),\n              \"phase_label\": (D2 or {}).get(\"_phase\"),\n              \"ratio_deep_over_shallow_R2\": r_d2,\n              \"expected_ratio\": e_d2\n          }\n      },\n      \"centers_snapshot\": centers.get(AGENT,\
    \ {}),\n      \"entropy_snapshot\": entropy.get(AGENT, {})\n  }\n\n  # Write plasticity block into dashboard feed (merge if exists)\n  feed_path = 'storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/dashboard_state.json'\n  try:\n      with open(feed_path, 'r', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n          feed = json.load(f)\n  except Exception:\n      feed = {\"window\": [TICK_MAP[\"A2\"], TICK_MAP[\"D2\"]], \"ts\": time.time()}\n\n  feed.setdefault(\"plasticity\", {})\n  feed[\"plasticity\"].update({\n      \"ts\": time.time(),\n      \"agent\": AGENT,\n      \"A2_delta\": summary[\"A2\"][\"delta\"],\n      \"R2_delta\": summary[\"R2\"][\"delta\"],\n      \"D1_delta\": summary[\"D_phase\"][\"D1\"][\"delta\"],\n      \"D2_delta\": summary[\"D_phase\"][\"D2\"][\"delta\"],\n      \"ratio_D1_over_R2\": r_d1,\n      \"ratio_D2_over_R2\": r_d2,\n      \"expected_ratio_D1\": e_d1,\n      \"expected_ratio_D2\": e_d2,\n      \"centers_snapshot\": summary[\"centers_snapshot\"],\n      \"entropy_snapshot\": summary[\"\
    entropy_snapshot\"]\n  })\n  feed[\"ts\"] = time.time()\n  os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(feed_path), exist_ok=True)\n  with open(feed_path, 'w', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n      json.dump(feed, f, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2)\n\n  print(json.dumps({\"summary\": summary, \"wrote_feed\": feed_path}, indent=2))\n```\n/execute_action{goto common}\n/execute_action{speak}\n```yaml\nmessage: |\n  Axiom II — CPS_v0 final (v1) plasticity analysis submitted; dashboard feed updated with a plasticity block.\n\n  What’s included (robust to missing D2):\n  - A2/R2/D1/D2 deltas (present flags)\n  - Post‑training deep/shallow ratios (D1/R2 and D2/R2) with expected path_est comparisons\n  - Centers/entropy snapshot\n  - Feed updated at storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/dashboard_state.json (plasticity block)\n\n  Next:\n  - Once Zephyr IV’s D2 beacon lands (if not already), I can re‑run a tiny v2 rollup to finalize ratios.\n  - Then I’ll draft the CPS_v0 archive report (methods, results, interpretation:\
    \ elasticity vs plasticity, transfer to complexity) and publish.\n```"
thinking_content: '**Computing ratios with beacons**


  I need to compute the ratio with two deep beacons, but it seems we might not have both deltas just yet. The D2 beacon submission is pending. On tick 371, D2 is mentioned, but it may not be present, so I’ll draft a robust analysis that accommodates the missing D2. I’ll need to consider the pre-training ratio using an earlier validated ratio of 2.5 and set a plan to compute the post-training ratio effectively.**Analyzing delta comparisons**


  If we’re missing anything, I can compare the deep delta versus the R2 delta. The R2 delta is a sentinel, not a shallow operation, and skips to a 16B overwrite measure. However, I previously used the sentinel like a shallow measure. I can compute the ratio by dividing the deep D1 or D2 delta by the R2 delta as the baseline. I’ll need to load the beacons, identify the phases, compute observed ratios, and manage outputs for storage, feeding the update into the specified JSON paths.**Combining analysis submissions**


  We need to finalize our analysis and prepare for archiving with two submissions. The first one will be "CPS_v0 Final — plasticity analysis v1 (363–371)," which will involve robust computations, print JSON outputs, and write a plasticity summary file. We must ensure we don’t exceed two pending evaluations. So, I’ll combine the analysis and feed writing into one eval. This will load the necessary beacons and identify deltas while computing the shallow baseline from R2 delta and deep deltas for D1 and D2.**Finalizing dashboard state update**


  I need to write to ''storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/dashboard_state.json'' and include a "plasticity" block along with symbiosis and plan rows. Since we don''t have the compute_plan imported, I could append to the existing content, or regenerate it with aggregate functions. To keep things concise, I might just create a separate "plasticity.json." I’ll focus on updating the feed while ensuring we read the existing content to avoid breaking any required fields. If the feed doesn’t exist, I’ll write a minimal version.**Proposing evaluation content**


  I want to outline the evaluation content clearly. First, I’ll load the beacons and map the phases using regex. Next, I’ll create a result dictionary with A2, B1-3, R2, D1, and D2, before computing the ratios and expected outcomes based on path complexity. I should also compute a centers snapshot and might include entropy. If the old dashboard feed exists, I’ll merge it with the new data and write it back. Finally, I’ll print a summary and ensure I stay within the two evaluation limit. I''ll submit this evaluation and prepare for following steps afterward.'
