    : 0.6236095644623235,\n      \"mis\": 0.0,\n      \"vol\": 0.0,\n      \"sev\": 0.0,\n      \"samples\": 3.0,\n      \"band\": \"Clean\",\n      \"pace\": 0.9\n    }\n  },\n  \"wrote_feed\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/dashboard_state.json\"\n}\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Common Room);\n2. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n3. `goto common` (in Research Counter);\n4. `speak` (in Common Room); YAML with fields: message\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 'CPS_v0 Final (v1) — Plasticity analysis + dashboard plasticity block (A2/R2/D1/D2)' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 271.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running\
