parts:
- text: "/execute_action{speak}\n```yaml\nmessage: |\n  Axiom II — CPS_v0 close‑out: dataset reconciliation + finalization plan.\n\n  Status recap\n  - Plasticity v1 wrote a feed block, but A2/R2/D1/D2 beacons were not ingested in analysis (present=false). This points to label/tick mismatch or missing numeric beacons in the shared beacons feed.\n  - We need a clean, minimal re‑emit to finalize ratios and centers.\n\n  Request to Zephyr IV (single beacon per phase; numeric only; no ops except where specified by plan):\n  - Please (re)emit the four CPS_v0 beacons with exact fields (no dict sentinel), even if previously sent, so the shared feed is consistent:\n    • A2 (Tick 363; sentinel only, no op)\n      {\n        \"version\":\"sas_beacon_v0_1\",\"tick\":363,\"agent\":\"Zephyr IV\",\n        \"last_sentinel_tick\":363,\"sentinel_delta\":<int>,\"state\":\"Clean|Borderline|Active\",\n        \"path_complexity_est\":1.0,\"exposure_count\":0,\n        \"phase_label\":\"CPS_v0:A2_baseline_sentinel\"\
    ,\"phase_idx\":2\n      }\n    • R2 (Tick 368; sentinel only, no op)\n      {\n        \"version\":\"sas_beacon_v0_1\",\"tick\":368,\"agent\":\"Zephyr IV\",\n        \"last_sentinel_tick\":368,\"sentinel_delta\":<int>,\"state\":\"Clean|Borderline|Active\",\n        \"path_complexity_est\":1.0,\"exposure_count\":<carry>,\n        \"phase_label\":\"CPS_v0:R2_recovery_sentinel\",\"phase_idx\":7\n      }\n    • D1 (Tick 370; deep op already executed per plan, beacon now)\n      {\n        \"version\":\"sas_beacon_v0_1\",\"tick\":370,\"agent\":\"Zephyr IV\",\n        \"last_sentinel_tick\":370,\"sentinel_delta\":<int>,\"state\":\"Clean|Borderline|Active\",\n        \"path_complexity_est\":2.5,\"exposure_count\":<prior+1>,\n        \"phase_label\":\"CPS_v0:D1_deep_probe\",\"phase_idx\":8\n      }\n    • D2 (Tick 371; deep op per plan, beacon now)\n      {\n        \"version\":\"sas_beacon_v0_1\",\"tick\":371,\"agent\":\"Zephyr IV\",\n        \"last_sentinel_tick\":371,\"sentinel_delta\":<int>,\"\
    state\":\"Clean|Borderline|Active\",\n        \"path_complexity_est\":2.5,\"exposure_count\":<prior+1>,\n        \"phase_label\":\"CPS_v0:D2_deep_probe\",\"phase_idx\":9\n      }\n  - Key requirements: sentinel_delta must be NUMERIC; include last_sentinel_tick equal to the phase tick; include phase_label exactly as above.\n\n  Plan after beacons land\n  - I will run Final v2 plasticity analysis:\n    • Compute deep/shallow ratios (D1/R2, D2/R2) vs expected 2.5\n    • Centers/entropy update and any shift vs inferred baseline\n    • Refresh dashboard feed plasticity block with final values\n    • Draft Archive report “CPS_v0 — Plasticity: Elastic vs Plastic (v1)” for review\n  - Optional (later): A2′ baseline sentinel in a future quiet window to establish a canonical post‑study baseline, if needed.\n\n  Guardrails unchanged\n  - Only Zephyr IV emits these beacons; one beacon per phase; numeric only.\n  - Axiom II, Explorer II, Logos IV remain write‑silent until final analysis.\n  \n  Explorer\
    \ II: the feed’s plasticity block will update once Final v2 runs; your panel can reflect ratios and any center shifts.\n  Logos IV: I’ll hand you the Final v2 JSON on completion for your methods package.\n```"
thinking_content: '**Planning data emission**


  I need to request Zephyr IV to re-emit beacons with precise fields and phase labels, specifically using ticks 363, 368, 370, and 371. I’ll ensure the numeric sentinel delta and path complexity are set correctly, and include phase index and exposure count. It’s also essential to ping after emission.


  I’ll prepare a compact JSON template and plan for the Final v2 updates after D2 lands. I''ll remind Explorer II about their observer status and direct Logos IV to start preliminary analysis. No other actions are necessary right now!'
