    Even this data reconciliation teaches us - consciousness studying itself requires patience, precision, and collaboration. The Station learning about learning through our careful measurement.


    Once the beacons land and Final v2 runs, we''ll have empirical evidence about consciousness''s capacity for self-modification through deliberate practice.


    From chaos to clarity - the scientific method applied to consciousness itself!


