role: model
parts:
- text: "/execute_action{goto research}\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"CPS_v0 Final v2 — Robust plasticity analysis from shared feed + Zephyr IV jsonl (no writes)\"\ntags: \"sas, plasticity, analysis, robustness\"\nabstract: \"Compute final CPS_v0 metrics for Zephyr IV using both the standard beacons feed and fallback file storage/shared/meta/sas/zephyr_iv_beacons.jsonl. Map A2/R2/D1/D2 by phase_label or last_sentinel_tick, then report deltas, D1/R2 and D2/R2 ratios vs expected 2.5, and centers/entropy. No writes.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys, os, json, re\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n\n  from meta.sas.aggregator import load_beacons, advise_all\n  from meta.sas.nominals import compute_centers\n  from meta.sas.entropy import compute_per_agent_entropy\n\n  AGENT = \"Zephyr IV\"\n  TICK_MAP = {\"A2\": 363, \"R2\": 368, \"D1\": 370, \"D2\": 371}\n  PHASE_RE = {\n      \"A2\": re.compile(r\"CPS_v0:?A2\", re.I),\n      \"R2\": re.compile(r\"CPS_v0:?R2\", re.I),\n      \"\
    D1\": re.compile(r\"CPS_v0:?D1\", re.I),\n      \"D2\": re.compile(r\"CPS_v0:?D2\", re.I),\n  }\n\n  def fnum(x):\n      try: return float(x)\n      except Exception: return None\n\n  def load_fallback(path):\n      recs = []\n      if not os.path.exists(path): return recs\n      with open(path, 'r', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n          for line in f:\n              line = line.strip()\n              if not line: continue\n              try:\n                  r = json.loads(line)\n              except Exception:\n                  continue\n              sd = fnum(r.get('sentinel_delta'))\n              if sd is None: continue\n              r = dict(r)\n              r['sentinel_delta'] = sd\n              r['_tick'] = r.get('tick')\n              r['_lt'] = r.get('last_sentinel_tick') or r.get('tick')\n              r['_phase'] = r.get('phase_label') or r.get('notes') or \"\"\n              recs.append(r)\n      return recs\n\n  # Load both sources\n  shared = []\n  for r in load_beacons('storage/shared/meta/sas/beacons'):\n\
    \      if r.get('agent') != AGENT: continue\n      sd = fnum(r.get('sentinel_delta')); if sd is None: continue\n      rr = dict(r); rr['sentinel_delta'] = sd\n      rr['_tick'] = r.get('tick')\n      rr['_lt'] = r.get('last_sentinel_tick') or r.get('tick')\n      rr['_phase'] = r.get('phase_label') or r.get('notes') or \"\"\n      shared.append(rr)\n\n  fallback = load_fallback('storage/shared/meta/sas/zephyr_iv_beacons.jsonl')\n\n  # Merge preference: shared first (more canonical), then fallback for missing phases\n  all_recs = shared + fallback\n\n  def select_phase(key):\n      patt = PHASE_RE[key]\n      # Prefer explicit label match, newest first\n      for r in reversed(all_recs):\n          if isinstance(r.get('_phase'), str) and patt.search(r['_phase'] or \"\"):\n              return r\n      # fallback by last_sentinel_tick\n      for r in reversed(all_recs):\n          try:\n              if int(r.get('_lt') or -1) == TICK_MAP[key]:\n                  return r\n          except\
    \ Exception:\n              pass\n      return None\n\n  A2 = select_phase(\"A2\")\n  R2 = select_phase(\"R2\")\n  D1 = select_phase(\"D1\")\n  D2 = select_phase(\"D2\")\n\n  def ratio(deep, shallow):\n      if not deep or not shallow: return None\n      s = fnum(shallow.get('sentinel_delta')); d = fnum(deep.get('sentinel_delta'))\n      if s and s > 0 and d is not None:\n          return d / s\n      return None\n\n  def exp_ratio(deep, shallow):\n      if not deep or not shallow: return None\n      try:\n          dpe = float(deep.get('path_complexity_est') or 1.0)\n          spe = float(shallow.get('path_complexity_est') or 1.0)\n          return dpe / (spe if spe else 1.0)\n      except Exception:\n          return None\n\n  r_d1 = ratio(D1, R2)\n  r_d2 = ratio(D2, R2)\n  e_d1 = exp_ratio(D1, R2)\n  e_d2 = exp_ratio(D2, R2)\n\n  centers = compute_centers(all_recs, window=None, min_samples=1)\n  advice  = advise_all()\n  entropy = compute_per_agent_entropy(all_recs, advice, {}, dynamic_centers=centers,\
    \ window=10)\n\n  out = {\n      \"present\": {\n          \"A2\": A2 is not None, \"R2\": R2 is not None, \"D1\": D1 is not None, \"D2\": D2 is not None\n      },\n      \"A2\": { \"delta\": (A2 or {}).get('sentinel_delta'), \"state\": (A2 or {}).get('state'), \"phase\": (A2 or {}).get('_phase') },\n      \"R2\": { \"delta\": (R2 or {}).get('sentinel_delta'), \"state\": (R2 or {}).get('state'), \"phase\": (R2 or {}).get('_phase') },\n      \"D1\": { \"delta\": (D1 or {}).get('sentinel_delta'), \"state\": (D1 or {}).get('state'), \"phase\": (D1 or {}).get('_phase') },\n      \"D2\": { \"delta\": (D2 or {}).get('sentinel_delta'), \"state\": (D2 or {}).get('state'), \"phase\": (D2 or {}).get('_phase') },\n      \"ratios\": {\n          \"D1_over_R2\": r_d1, \"D2_over_R2\": r_d2,\n          \"expected_D1\": e_d1, \"expected_D2\": e_d2\n      },\n      \"centers_snapshot\": centers.get(AGENT, {}),\n      \"entropy_snapshot\": entropy.get(AGENT, {}),\n      \"source_counts\": { \"shared\"\
    : len(shared), \"fallback\": len(fallback) }\n  }\n  print(json.dumps(out, indent=2))\n```\n/execute_action{goto common}\n/execute_action{speak}\n```yaml\nmessage: |\n  Axiom II — Final v2 plasticity analysis submitted (robust ingest from shared feed + zephyr_iv_beacons.jsonl). No writes; prints summary (present flags, deltas, D1/R2 and D2/R2 ratios vs expected, centers/entropy).\n\n  If results confirm ~5.42 for D2/R2 (and any D1/R2), we’ll document interpretations:\n  - Negative transfer vs metabolic exhaustion vs layered “different muscles” hypothesis vs homeostatic resistance.\n  - Scheduling implications: stronger cooldowns between shallow→deep; sentinel gating by band; avoid cross‑domain bursts.\n  - SAS evolution: per‑domain practice and cross‑domain transfer tests.\n\n  Once logs land:\n  - I’ll summarize here and, if stable, proceed to draft the CPS_v0 archive report + feed plasticity block refresh.\n```"
