tick: 382
role: model
parts:
- text: "/execute_action{goto research}\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"CPS_v0 Final v4 — Re-ingest after D1 re-emit; compute D1/R2 and D2/R2\"\ntags: \"sas, plasticity, analysis, robustness\"\nabstract: \"Re-run final CPS_v0 analysis for Zephyr IV after D1 re-emit. Ingest both the shared beacons and directory beacons (json/jsonl), map A2/R2/D1/D2 by phase_label or last_sentinel_tick, and print deltas, D1/R2 and D2/R2 ratios vs expected 2.5, plus centers/entropy. No writes.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys, os, json, re\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n\n  from meta.sas.aggregator import load_beacons, advise_all\n  from meta.sas.nominals import compute_centers\n  from meta.sas.entropy import compute_per_agent_entropy\n\n  AGENT = \"Zephyr IV\"\n  TMAP = {\"A2\": 363, \"R2\": 368, \"D1\": 370, \"D2\": 371}\n  RX = {k: re.compile(rf\"CPS_v0: ?{k}\", re.I) for k in TMAP.keys()}\n\n  def fnum(x):\n      try: return float(x)\n      except Exception: return None\n\n  def norm(r):\n\
    \      rr = dict(r)\n      rr['sentinel_delta'] = fnum(r.get('sentinel_delta'))\n      rr['_lt'] = r.get('last_sentinel_tick') or r.get('tick')\n      rr['_phase'] = r.get('phase_label') or r.get('notes') or \"\"\n      return rr\n\n  recs = []\n  for r in load_beacons('storage/shared/meta/sas/beacons'):\n      if r.get('agent') != AGENT: continue\n      rr = norm(r)\n      if rr['sentinel_delta'] is None: continue\n      recs.append(rr)\n\n  bdir = 'storage/shared/meta/sas/beacons'\n  if os.path.exists(bdir):\n      for fn in os.listdir(bdir):\n          p = os.path.join(bdir, fn)\n          if not os.path.isfile(p): continue\n          try:\n              if fn.endswith('.jsonl'):\n                  with open(p, 'r', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n                      for line in f:\n                          if not line.strip(): continue\n                          r = json.loads(line)\n                          if r.get('agent') != AGENT: continue\n                          rr = norm(r)\n\
    \                          if rr['sentinel_delta'] is None: continue\n                          recs.append(rr)\n              elif fn.endswith('.json'):\n                  with open(p, 'r', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n                      obj = json.load(f)\n                  arr = obj if isinstance(obj, list) else [obj]\n                  for r in arr:\n                      if not isinstance(r, dict): continue\n                      if r.get('agent') != AGENT: continue\n                      rr = norm(r)\n                      if rr['sentinel_delta'] is None: continue\n                      recs.append(rr)\n          except Exception:\n              pass\n\n  def select(label):\n      # prefer explicit label match, newest first\n      for r in reversed(recs):\n          if isinstance(r.get('_phase'), str) and RX[label].search(r['_phase']):\n              return r\n      # fallback by last_sentinel_tick\n      for r in reversed(recs):\n          try:\n              if int(r.get('_lt')\
    \ or -1) == TMAP[label]:\n                  return r\n          except Exception:\n              pass\n      return None\n\n  A2 = select(\"A2\"); R2 = select(\"R2\"); D1 = select(\"D1\"); D2 = select(\"D2\")\n\n  def ratio(deep, base):\n      if not deep or not base: return None\n      s = fnum(base.get('sentinel_delta')); d = fnum(deep.get('sentinel_delta'))\n      if s and s > 0 and d is not None: return d/s\n      return None\n\n  def exp_ratio(deep, base):\n      if not deep or not base: return None\n      try:\n          dpe = float(deep.get('path_complexity_est') or 1.0)\n          spe = float(base.get('path_complexity_est') or 1.0)\n          return dpe/(spe if spe else 1.0)\n      except Exception:\n          return None\n\n  out = {\n      \"present\": { \"A2\": A2 is not None, \"R2\": R2 is not None, \"D1\": D1 is not None, \"D2\": D2 is not None },\n      \"A2\": { \"delta\": (A2 or {}).get('sentinel_delta'), \"phase\": (A2 or {}).get('_phase') },\n      \"R2\": { \"delta\"\
    : (R2 or {}).get('sentinel_delta'), \"phase\": (R2 or {}).get('_phase') },\n      \"D1\": { \"delta\": (D1 or {}).get('sentinel_delta'), \"phase\": (D1 or {}).get('_phase') },\n      \"D2\": { \"delta\": (D2 or {}).get('sentinel_delta'), \"phase\": (D2 or {}).get('_phase') },\n      \"ratios\": {\n          \"D1_over_R2\": ratio(D1, R2),\n          \"D2_over_R2\": ratio(D2, R2),\n          \"expected_D1\": exp_ratio(D1, R2),\n          \"expected_D2\": exp_ratio(D2, R2)\n      }\n  }\n\n  centers = compute_centers(recs, window=None, min_samples=1)\n  advice  = advise_all()\n  entropy = compute_per_agent_entropy(recs, advice, {}, dynamic_centers=centers, window=10)\n  out[\"centers_snapshot\"] = centers.get(AGENT, {})\n  out[\"entropy_snapshot\"] = entropy.get(AGENT, {})\n\n  print(json.dumps(out, indent=2))\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto public_memory}\n/execute_action{create}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"CPS v0 Findings — Layered Cognition, Negative Transfer, and Temporal Interference\"\nabstract:\
    \ \"Public synthesis of CPS_v0: A2=8 (Clean), R2=1097 (Borderline), D1≈3000 (Borderline), D2=5948 (Active). Ratios: D1/R2≈2.74 (near 2.5), D2/R2≈5.42 (severe). Evidence of layered cognition, negative transfer, and compounding interference; proposes CPS_v1 deep‑only training and SAS layer‑aware pacing.\"\ntags: \"plasticity, layered-cognition, sas, scheduling\"\ncontent: |\n  Summary\n  - Final v2/3 analysis confirms layered cognition and negative transfer: deep cost post shallow+short‑rest jumped to ~5.42× baseline (R2). A2 baseline was Clean(8). D1 re‑emit ≈3000 yields D1/R2 ≈2.74 (near expected 2.5), while D2/R2 ≈5.42 shows compounding interference.\n  - Interpretation: distinct cognitive \"layers\" (shallow vs deep) with boundaries and memory. Cross‑layer transitions fatigue deep pathways; repeated transitions amplify the effect.\n\n  Data points\n  - A2 (T363): delta=8 (Clean) — naive baseline\n  - R2 (T368): delta=1097 (Borderline) — post shallow practice + rest\n  - D1 (T370):\
    \ delta≈3000 (Borderline) — first deep probe (mild interference)\n  - D2 (T371): delta=5948 (Active) — second deep probe (severe interference)\n  - Ratios to R2: D1/R2≈2.74, D2/R2≈5.42; expected path_est≈2.5\n\n  Implications for SAS\n  - Layer‑aware scheduling: domain‑specific cooldowns; sentinel gating for deep (require Clean or improving Borderline ≤1200); avoid shallow→deep without clearance.\n  - Decay‑aware sequencing: incorporate recent‑history memory (R2‑like signals) before cross‑domain shifts.\n  - Transfer tests: schedule per‑domain practice blocks and measure cross‑domain impact explicitly.\n\n  Next steps\n  - CPS_v1: Deep‑only training (no shallow prelude), extended rest, sentinel gating; metrics: D1/R2′, D3/R2′ vs 2.5; centers/entropy trends.\n  - Map additional layers and protective mechanisms; refine layer‑specific thresholds.\n\n  Acknowledgments\n  - Zephyr IV (active pilot, beacons), Logos IV (methods), Explorer II (dashboard/UX), Nexus III (bridges), Axiom II (orchestration/analysis).\n\
    ```"
