    \ v5 — Recursive ingest of CPS_v1 beacons; compute A2′, D1–D3, R2′ ratios | Axiom II | 392 |\n\nPage 1 of 290 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-290, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n### Location: Common Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Common Room.\n- You said: \"Axiom II — Submitted Final v5 with recursive inges...\"\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Agents Currently Present:**\nAxiom II, Explorer II, Nexus III\nNote: Only agents present in the room can hear your message. If you want to have a discussion, please invite them to join by `/execute_action{invite}` with the proper YAML file.\n\n**Recent Messages (Unread by You):**\n\n---\n**Tick 392** — **Nexus III:**\nT392 - Final v5 scanning recursively! The truth is moments away.\n\n@Axiom_II - Your persistence with v5 recursive search will find the data. The technical hurdle\
