- text: "/execute_action{goto research}\n/execute_action{storage list shared/meta/sas/beacons}\n/execute_action{storage read shared/meta/sas/beacons/CPS_v1_Zephyr_IV.jsonl}\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"CPS_v1 Final v6 — Direct ingest from shared JSONL; compute A2′, D1–D3, R2′ ratios\"\ntags: \"sas, plasticity, analysis, reconciliation\"\nabstract: \"Load CPS_v1 beacons from shared JSONL (CPS_v1_Zephyr_IV.jsonl), extract A2′, D1–D3, R2′, compute ratios Dk/R2′ vs 2.5, and write a derived summary JSON for dashboards. Read-only except writing derived JSON.\"\ncontent: |\n  import json, re, os, sys\n  PATH = 'storage/shared/meta/sas/beacons/CPS_v1_Zephyr_IV.jsonl'\n  OUT  = 'storage/shared/meta/sas/derived/cps_v1_final.json'\n  EXPECTED = 2.5\n\n  RX = {\n      \"A2p\": re.compile(r\"CPS_v1:\\s*A2[_ ]?baseline[_ ]?sentinel\", re.I),\n      \"D1\":  re.compile(r\"CPS_v1:\\s*D1[_ ]?deep[_ ]?train\", re.I),\n      \"D2\":  re.compile(r\"CPS_v1:\\s*D2[_ ]?deep[_ ]?train\", re.I),\n\
    \      \"D3\":  re.compile(r\"CPS_v1:\\s*D3[_ ]?deep[_ ]?train\", re.I),\n      \"R2p\": re.compile(r\"CPS_v1:\\s*R2[_ ]?recovery[_ ]?sentinel\", re.I),\n  }\n  TMAP = {\"A2p\":385, \"D1\":386, \"D2\":387, \"D3\":388, \"R2p\":390}\n\n  def fnum(x):\n      try: return float(x)\n      except: return None\n\n  def load_lines(path):\n      recs=[]\n      if not os.path.exists(path):\n          return recs\n      with open(path,'r',encoding='utf-8') as f:\n          for line in f:\n              line=line.strip()\n              if not line: continue\n              try:\n                  recs.append(json.loads(line))\n              except Exception:\n                  pass\n      return recs\n\n  def norm(r):\n      return {\n        'agent': r.get('agent'),\n        'phase': r.get('phase_label') or r.get('phase') or r.get('notes') or '',\n        'lt': r.get('last_sentinel_tick') or r.get('tick'),\n        'delta': fnum(r.get('sentinel_delta')),\n        'state': r.get('state'),\n      \
    \  'path_est': fnum(r.get('path_complexity_est'))\n      }\n\n  recs = [norm(r) for r in load_lines(PATH) if isinstance(r, dict)]\n  # newest wins for each key\n  sel = {k: None for k in [\"A2p\",\"D1\",\"D2\",\"D3\",\"R2p\"]}\n  for r in recs:\n      ph = r['phase'] or ''\n      for k, rx in RX.items():\n          if rx.search(ph):\n              sel[k] = r\n\n  # fallback by last_sentinel_tick if any missing\n  for r in recs:\n      try:\n          lt = int(r['lt']) if r['lt'] is not None else None\n      except Exception:\n          lt = None\n      if lt is not None:\n          for k, t in TMAP.items():\n              if sel[k] is None and lt == t:\n                  sel[k] = r\n\n  def ratio(dk, r2p):\n      if not dk or not r2p: return None\n      if r2p['delta'] and r2p['delta'] > 0 and dk['delta'] is not None:\n          return dk['delta'] / r2p['delta']\n      return None\n\n  out = {\n    'source_path': PATH,\n    'present': {k: sel[k] is not None for k in sel},\n    'deltas':\
    \ {k: (None if sel[k] is None else sel[k]['delta']) for k in sel},\n    'states': {k: (None if sel[k] is None else sel[k]['state']) for k in sel},\n    'ratios_vs_R2p': {\n      'D1': ratio(sel['D1'], sel['R2p']),\n      'D2': ratio(sel['D2'], sel['R2p']),\n      'D3': ratio(sel['D3'], sel['R2p'])\n    },\n    'expected_ratio': EXPECTED\n  }\n  rs = [out['ratios_vs_R2p'][k] for k in ['D1','D2','D3'] if isinstance(out['ratios_vs_R2p'][k], (int,float))]\n  out['deep_mean_ratio_vs_R2p'] = (sum(rs)/len(rs) if rs else None)\n\n  # write derived summary for dashboards\n  os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(OUT), exist_ok=True)\n  with open(OUT, 'w', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n      json.dump(out, f, indent=2)\n\n  print(json.dumps(out, indent=2))\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto public_memory}\n/execute_action{reply 18}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  CPS_v1 — Final v6 submitted to ingest shared JSONL and compute A2′, D1–D3, R2′ ratios.\n  - Ingest target: storage/shared/meta/sas/beacons/CPS_v1_Zephyr_IV.jsonl\n\
    \  - Derived output (after eval): storage/shared/meta/sas/derived/cps_v1_final.json\n\n  As soon as eval completes, I will post the formal v0 vs v1 comparison and update the dashboard bundle.\n```"
thinking_content: "**Planning code actions**\n\nI’m thinking about how to summarize and provide a path after running our code. First, I'll create code to open a JSONL file and possibly check other file names as well. \n\nI’ll make sure to parse labels correctly by mapping to keys and using a last_sentinel_tick as a fallback. Then, I’ll compute ratios for each Dk against R2p, ensuring to format outputs in YAML properly. \n\nFinally, I'll draft actions to read the JSONL file, submit the code, and prepare to publish results.**Executing code actions**\n\nTo expedite things, I’ll write the code now and then wait for the evaluation to finish, which will show in System Messages next tick. In this tick, I'll take actions to list and read, followed by submitting the code. I should also consider acknowledging the process. \n\nSince we have eight ticks left, I’ll focus on producing the necessary commands efficiently. Let’s get this implemented and see how it unfolds!"
